#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Up the {productname} {smr} Environment using containerized proxy"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Lingkungan {productname} {smr} menggunakan proksi dalam kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To set up the {productname} {smr} environment, you will need to have already "
"installed and configured:"
msgstr "Untuk menyiapkan lingkungan {productname} {smr}, Anda harus sudah menginstal dan mengonfigurasi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:3
msgid "{productname} {smr} Server 4.3 or newer"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} Server 4.3 atau yang lebih baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:4
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:3
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:3
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:3
msgid "{productname} {smr} Server"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:5
msgid "one or more {productname} {smr} containerized proxies"
msgstr "satu atau beberapa proksi {productname} {smr} dalam kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:6
msgid "one or more {productname} build host"
msgstr "satu atau beberapa host build {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This section covers how to configure your environment using containerized "
"{productname} Proxy for `Saltboot` deployment."
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas cara mengonfigurasi lingkungan Anda menggunakan {productname} Proxy dalam kontainer untuk penerapan `Saltboot`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow not longer implicitly configures DHCP for PXE "
"booting.  Without the formula, make sure your DHCP server has correct PXE "
"booting setting pointing to containerized proxy.  For more information how "
"to use DHCP formula to configure DHCP server, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[]."
msgstr "Alur kerja berbasis kontainer tidak lagi secara implisit mengonfigurasi DHCP untuk boot PXE.  Jika tidak menggunakan formula, pastikan server DHCP Anda memiliki pengaturan boot PXE yang benar dan mengarah ke proksi dalam kontainer.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang cara menggunakan formula DHCP untuk mengonfigurasi server DHCP, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and assumptions"
msgstr "Persyaratan dan asumsi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow requires POS images build using {productname} Server "
"4.3 or newer.  Older images will not work."
msgstr "Alur kerja berbasis kontainer memerlukan image POS yang dibuat menggunakan {productname} Server 4.3 atau yang lebih baru.  Image yang lebih lama tidak akan berfungsi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow requires POS images build using the newest "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "Alur kerja berbasis kontainer memerlukan image POS yang dibuat menggunakan {productname} Server versi terbaru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:12
msgid "In this example we are going to use branch id `B0001`."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, kita akan menggunakan ID cabang `B0001`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:13
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:12
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:12
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:11
msgid ""
"As a terminal we assume to have one terminal with hardware manufacturer "
"`TerminalOEM` and model `T1000`."
msgstr "Untuk terminal, diasumsikan tersedia satu terminal dengan produsen perangkat keras `TerminalOEM` dan model `T1000`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:14
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:13
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:13
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:12
msgid "For POS image we assume to have one with name `POS_Image_JeOS7`."
msgstr "Untuk image POS, diasumsikan tersedia satu image bernama `POS_Image_JeOS7`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:15
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create required system groups"
msgstr "Membuat grup sistem yang diperlukan"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Prosedur"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Create the following three system groups.  For guidelines on how to create "
"the groups, see xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "Buat tiga grup sistem berikut.  Untuk panduan tentang cara membuat grup, lihat xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:18
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:18
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:36
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:16
msgid "`TERMINALS`"
msgstr "`TERMINALS`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:19
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:19
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:17
msgid "`HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000`"
msgstr "`HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:20
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:20
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:18
msgid "`B0001`"
msgstr "`B0001`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:21
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The first group is generic optional group for collecting all POS terminals.  "
"The second group is hardware type group for our POS terminal.  The third "
"group is mandatory branch group."
msgstr "Grup pertama adalah grup umum opsional untuk mengelompokkan semua terminal POS.  Grup kedua adalah grup jenis perangkat keras untuk terminal POS kita.  Grup ketiga adalah grup cabang yang wajib dibuat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:22
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:22
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more information about {saltboot} groups, see "
"xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang grup {saltboot}, lihat xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Assign `Saltboot Group` formula to group `B0001` we just created.  This "
"converts the branch group to `Saltboot Group`."
msgstr "Tetapkan formula `Saltboot Group` ke grup `B0001` yang baru saja kita buat.  Tindakan ini mengubah grup cabang tersebut menjadi `Saltboot Group`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:24
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "{saltboot} group"
msgstr "Grup {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:25
msgid "Containerized {productname} {smr} is configured in `Saltboot Group`."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} dalam kontainer dikonfigurasi di `Saltboot Group`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:26
msgid ""
"{saltboot} groups are branch groups, system group with `branch id` as its "
"name and `Saltboot Group` formula enabled."
msgstr "Grup {saltboot} adalah grup cabang, yaitu grup sistem yang menggunakan `branch id` sebagai namanya dan mengaktifkan formula `Saltboot Group`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:27
msgid ""
"`Saltboot Group` formula is a successor of `Branch Network formula`, `PXE "
"formula` and `TFTP formula` used in regular {productname} {smr} setups."
msgstr "Formula `Saltboot Group` merupakan penerus `Branch Network formula`, `PXE formula`, dan `TFTP formula` yang digunakan dalam penyiapan {productname} {smr} biasa."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Name of the `Saltboot Group` is automatically used as a `branch id`, an "
"identifier for group of machines booted through particular containerized "
"{productname} Proxy."
msgstr "Nama `Saltboot Group` secara otomatis digunakan sebagai `branch id`, yaitu pengenal untuk sekelompok mesin yang melakukan boot melalui {productname} Proxy dalam kontainer tertentu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:29
msgid ""
"All `Saltboot` deployed machines though containerized proxy will "
"automatically became members of its `Saltboot group`."
msgstr "Semua mesin yang diterapkan menggunakan `Saltboot` melalui proksi dalam kontainer akan secara otomatis menjadi anggota `Saltboot group` proksi tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:30
msgid ""
"To connect `Saltboot group` with containerized proxy, fill `Image Download "
"Server` entry with Fully Qualified Domain Name (`FQDN`) of the containerized "
"proxy."
msgstr "Untuk menghubungkan `Saltboot group` dengan proksi dalam kontainer, isi entri `Image Download Server` dengan Fully Qualified Domain Name (`FQDN`) proksi dalam kontainer tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:31
msgid ""
"With this, mandatory configuration is finished.  The rest of configuration "
"is optional."
msgstr "Dengan demikian, konfigurasi wajib telah selesai.  Konfigurasi lainnya bersifat opsional."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default boot image"
msgstr "Image boot default"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Configure `Default boot image for new registrations` to specify what boot "
"image should be booted by not yet registered POS terminal."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan `Default boot image for new registrations` untuk menentukan image boot yang harus digunakan oleh terminal POS yang belum terdaftar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:34
msgid ""
"This is useful when stable boot image is wanted for initial deployments.  "
"Without this setting, newest built boot image is used as default boot image."
msgstr "Pengaturan ini berguna jika diperlukan image boot yang stabil untuk penerapan awal.  Tanpa pengaturan ini, image boot yang paling baru dibuat akan digunakan sebagai image boot default."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If `Default boot image for new registrations` is set, option to set its "
"version appears under name `Default boot image version` where specific image "
"version can be set."
msgstr "Jika `Default boot image for new registrations` ditetapkan, opsi untuk menentukan versinya akan muncul dengan nama `Default boot image version`, tempat versi image tertentu dapat ditetapkan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Kernel option for the {saltboot} group"
msgstr "Opsi kernel untuk grup {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Option `Kernel parameters for the group` can be used to pass extra kernel "
"options to all POS terminals registered withing this {saltboot} group."
msgstr "Opsi `Kernel parameters for the group` dapat digunakan untuk meneruskan opsi kernel tambahan ke semua terminal POS yang terdaftar dalam grup {saltboot} ini."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Naming scheme for new registrations"
msgstr "Skema penamaan untuk pendaftaran baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Last three options are related to how will be newly registered machine "
"visible in {productname} Server."
msgstr "Tiga opsi terakhir berkaitan dengan cara mesin yang baru terdaftar ditampilkan di {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For explanation of possible configurations, see "
"xref:retail:retail-terminal-names.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk penjelasan tentang konfigurasi yang tersedia, lihat xref:retail:retail-terminal-names.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Comparing containerized and non-containerized workflows"
msgstr "Perbandingan alur kerja berbasis kontainer dan tanpa kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:42
msgid "External DHCP service must be used with containerized {saltboot}."
msgstr "Layanan DHCP eksternal harus digunakan dengan {saltboot} berbasis kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For more information about how to enable PXE booting in DHCP service, see "
"xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang cara mengaktifkan boot PXE pada layanan DHCP, lihat xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow relies on updated image building in {productname} "
"Server 4.3, where PXE images are no longer collected as bundle, but kernel, "
"initrd and filesystem image are collected individually."
msgstr "Alur kerja berbasis kontainer bergantung pada proses pembuatan image yang diperbarui di {productname} Server 4.3, dengan image PXE tidak lagi dikumpulkan sebagai satu paket, melainkan kernel, initrd, dan image sistem berkas dikumpulkan secara terpisah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow relies on updated image building in {productname} "
"Server, where PXE images are no longer collected as bundle, but kernel, "
"initrd and filesystem image are collected individually."
msgstr "Alur kerja berbasis kontainer bergantung pada proses pembuatan image yang diperbarui di {productname} Server, dengan image PXE tidak lagi dikumpulkan sebagai satu paket, melainkan kernel, initrd, dan image sistem berkas dikumpulkan secara terpisah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow uses new TFTP container which instead of providing "
"files present on the proxy, routes TFTP requests as HTTP requests through "
"local proxy to {productname} Server."
msgstr "Alur kerja berbasis kontainer menggunakan kontainer TFTP baru yang, alih-alih menyediakan berkas yang ada di proksi, meneruskan permintaan TFTP sebagai permintaan HTTP melalui proksi lokal ke {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Containerized proxy is not a {salt} client, it is not possible to call "
"`image-sync` state."
msgstr "Proksi dalam kontainer bukan merupakan klien {salt}, sehingga state `image-sync` tidak dapat dipanggil."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Once POS image is built and made available on {productname} Server, it is "
"immediately available to the {saltboot} clients as well.  Image "
"synchronization is not needed, nor available.  This may have implications on "
"how images are deployed to production."
msgstr "Setelah image POS dibuat dan tersedia di {productname} Server, image tersebut juga langsung tersedia bagi klien {saltboot}.  Sinkronisasi image tidak diperlukan dan tidak tersedia.  Hal ini dapat memengaruhi cara image diterapkan ke lingkungan produksi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:49
msgid ""
"The following sections differentiate between containerized and regular "
"workflow.  Both are assuming proxy (containerized or in form of "
"{productname} {smr} Branch Server) are available."
msgstr "Bagian berikut membedakan alur kerja berbasis kontainer dan alur kerja biasa.  Keduanya mengasumsikan bahwa proksi, baik dalam kontainer maupun dalam bentuk {productname} {smr} Branch Server, sudah tersedia."

#. Containerized workflow::
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying with containerized workflow"
msgstr "Prosedur: Penerapan dengan alur kerja berbasis kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:51
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:56
msgid "Build POS image"
msgstr "Buat image POS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:52
msgid "Configure DHCP server for PXE booting for given network"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan server DHCP untuk boot PXE pada jaringan yang ditentukan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:53
msgid "Create `Saltboot group` and configure it for existing containerized proxy"
msgstr "Buat `Saltboot group` dan konfigurasikan untuk proksi dalam kontainer yang sudah tersedia"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:54
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:61
msgid "Boot system to be deployed"
msgstr "Lakukan boot pada sistem yang akan diterapkan"

#. Non-Containerized workflow::
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying with non-ontainerized workflow"
msgstr "Prosedur: Penerapan dengan alur kerja tanpa kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:57
msgid "Configure and apply Retail formulas on {productname} {smr} Branch server"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan dan terapkan formula Ritel pada {productname} {smr} Branch Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:58
msgid "Apply `highstate` state on the Branch server"
msgstr "Terapkan state `highstate` pada server cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:59
msgid "Create `branch group` with the name of Branch ID as set in retail formulas"
msgstr "Buat `branch group` dengan nama yang sesuai dengan ID Cabang yang ditetapkan dalam formula ritel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:60
msgid "Apply `image-sync` state on configured {productname} {smr} Branch server"
msgstr "Terapkan state `image-sync` pada {productname} {smr} Branch Server yang telah dikonfigurasi"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Validating {saltboot} group configuration"
msgstr "Memvalidasi konfigurasi grup {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:63
msgid ""
"`Containerized Saltboot` utilizes `Cobbler` system underneath for managing "
"PXE and UEFI configuration."
msgstr "`Containerized Saltboot` menggunakan sistem `Cobbler` sebagai sistem dasar untuk mengelola konfigurasi PXE dan UEFI."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:64
msgid ""
"When new PXE image is built (such as {productname} {smr} POS_Image_JeOS "
"images) `cobbler distro` and `cobbler profile` are automatically generated "
"for this image."
msgstr "Saat image PXE baru dibuat, seperti image {productname} {smr} POS_Image_JeOS, `cobbler distro` dan `cobbler profile` secara otomatis dibuat untuk image tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:65
msgid ""
"For example, when first image `POS_Image_JeOS` version `7.0.0` is build "
"under organization with number 1 `cobbler list` will show:"
msgstr "Misalnya, ketika image pertama `POS_Image_JeOS` versi `7.0.0` dibuat dalam organisasi bernomor 1, `cobbler list` akan menampilkan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:66
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "# cobbler list\n"
msgstr "# cobbler list\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:67
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"distros:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
msgstr ""
"distros:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"profiles:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
msgstr ""
"profiles:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:69
msgid ""
"These entries contain information about kernel and initrd.  These entries "
"are however not yet available for PXE booting."
msgstr "Entri ini berisi informasi tentang kernel dan initrd.  Namun, entri ini belum tersedia untuk boot PXE."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Only when `Saltboot group` is created, new {cobbler} profile is created for "
"this `Saltboot group` which points to `cobbler distro` based on default boot "
"image configuration."
msgstr "Hanya setelah `Saltboot group` dibuat, profil {cobbler} baru akan dibuat untuk `Saltboot group` ini, yang mengarah ke `cobbler distro` berdasarkan konfigurasi image boot default."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:71
msgid ""
"For example, when system group `B0001` is created and `Saltboot group "
"formula` is assigned and configured for this group, new {cobbler} profile is "
"created."
msgstr "Misalnya, ketika grup sistem `B0001` dibuat dan `Saltboot group formula` ditetapkan serta dikonfigurasi untuk grup ini, profil {cobbler} baru akan dibuat."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"profiles:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
"   1-B0001\n"
msgstr ""
"profiles:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
"   1-B0001\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:75
msgid ""
"When inspecting this new group using command `cobbler profile report --name "
"1-B0001` details of this profile reveal configuration of this {saltboot} "
"group."
msgstr "Saat grup baru ini diperiksa menggunakan perintah `cobbler profile report --name 1-B0001`, detail profil ini menunjukkan konfigurasi grup {saltboot} tersebut."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "# cobbler profile report --name 1-B0001\n"
msgstr "# cobbler profile report --name 1-B0001\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name                           : 1-B0001\n"
"Comment                        : Saltboot group B0001 of organization SUSE "
"default profile\n"
"Distribution                   : 1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
"Kernel Options                 : {'MASTER': ['downloadserver.example.org'], "
"'MINION_ID_PREFIX': ['B0001']}\n"
msgstr ""
"Name                           : 1-B0001\n"
"Comment                        : Saltboot group B0001 of organization SUSE default profile\n"
"Distribution                   : 1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
"Kernel Options                 : {'MASTER': ['downloadserver.example.org'], 'MINION_ID_PREFIX': ['B0001']}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:78
msgid ""
"Kernel options in example are always present and are internal for {saltboot} "
"functionality."
msgstr "Opsi kernel dalam contoh selalu ada dan digunakan secara internal untuk fungsionalitas {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:79
msgid ""
"With this information `Cobbler` is able to generate required PXE and UEFI "
"Grub configurations which can be checked in "
"`/srv/tftpboot/pxelinux.cfg/default` and "
"`/srv/tftpboot/grub/x86_64_menu_items.cfg`."
msgstr "Dengan informasi ini, `Cobbler` dapat menghasilkan konfigurasi PXE dan UEFI Grub yang diperlukan, yang dapat diperiksa di `/srv/tftpboot/pxelinux.cfg/default` dan `/srv/tftpboot/grub/x86_64_menu_items.cfg`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:80
msgid ""
"These files contain the end result which will be used by PXE client when "
"determining what to boot and with which parameters."
msgstr "Berkas-berkas ini berisi hasil akhir yang akan digunakan oleh klien PXE untuk menentukan apa yang akan di-boot dan parameter yang digunakan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:81
msgid ""
"If all built OS images are removed while a branch {saltboot} group is "
"configured, the corresponding {cobbler} profile for this group will also be "
"removed.  This is expected behavior.  However, when a new image is "
"subsequently built, a new {cobbler} entry is not automatically generated for "
"the group, resulting in a missing entry in the boot menu."
msgstr "Jika semua image OS yang telah dibuat dihapus sementara grup {saltboot} cabang masih dikonfigurasi, profil {cobbler} yang terkait dengan grup ini juga akan dihapus.  Ini merupakan perilaku yang diharapkan.  Namun, ketika image baru kemudian dibuat, entri {cobbler} baru tidak secara otomatis dibuat untuk grup tersebut, sehingga entri dalam menu boot tidak tersedia."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:82
msgid ""
"To recreate the required {cobbler} entry, you must open and resave the "
"{saltboot} Group formula."
msgstr "Untuk membuat ulang entri {cobbler} yang diperlukan, Anda harus membuka dan menyimpan ulang formula Grup {saltboot}."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set Up the {productname} {smr} Environment with Dedicated Network for "
"Terminal"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Lingkungan {productname} {smr} dengan Jaringan Khusus untuk Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:4
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:4
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:4
msgid "one or more {productname} {smr} branch server proxies"
msgstr "satu atau beberapa proksi server cabang {productname} {smr}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:5
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:5
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:5
msgid "one or more POS images built"
msgstr "satu atau beberapa image POS yang telah dibuat"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:6
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:6
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "Asumsi"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This guide works only with non-containerized {productname} {smr} branch "
"proxy 4.3."
msgstr "Panduan ini hanya berlaku untuk proksi cabang {productname} {smr} 4.3 tanpa kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:8
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In this example we consider architecture with dedicated network for POS "
"terminals where branch server provides all required services including DHCP "
"and DNS."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, kita menggunakan arsitektur dengan jaringan khusus untuk terminal POS, dengan server cabang menyediakan semua layanan yang diperlukan, termasuk DHCP dan DNS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:9
msgid "For dedicated network we assume `192.168.86.0/24` network."
msgstr "Untuk jaringan khusus, kita mengasumsikan penggunaan jaringan `192.168.86.0/24`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In this example we provide `{salt}` and `ftp` CNAMEs for {saltboot} service "
"discovery."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, kita menyediakan CNAME `{salt}` dan `ftp` untuk penemuan layanan {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:11
msgid ""
"We assume to have one regular branch server with {salt} minion id "
"`branch1.mystore.com`, which is equal to the branch server fully qualified "
"domain name, and branch id `B0001`."
msgstr "Diasumsikan tersedia satu server cabang biasa dengan ID minion {salt} `branch1.mystore.com`, yang sama dengan nama domain lengkap server cabang, serta ID cabang `B0001`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This example covers two configuration methods.  Both of the methods achieve "
"the same result."
msgstr "Contoh ini mencakup dua metode konfigurasi.  Kedua metode tersebut memberikan hasil yang sama."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Required System Groups"
msgstr "Membuat Grup Sistem yang Diperlukan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Manually setting up formulas requires manual creation of the needed system "
"groups, unlike when using the provided tools.  To create the system groups, "
"see xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "Penyiapan formula secara manual mengharuskan pembuatan grup sistem yang diperlukan secara manual, berbeda dengan penggunaan alat yang disediakan.  Untuk membuat grup sistem, lihat xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:17
msgid "You will need the following groups:"
msgstr "Anda memerlukan grup berikut:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign and Configure Branch Server Formulas"
msgstr "Menetapkan dan Mengonfigurasi Formula Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:24
msgid "We assign the following formulas to the branch server:"
msgstr "Kita menetapkan formula berikut ke server cabang:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:25
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:23
msgid "Branch Network"
msgstr "Branch Network"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:26
msgid "Dhcpd"
msgstr "Dhcpd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:27
msgid "Bind"
msgstr "Bind"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:28
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:24
msgid "Pxe"
msgstr "Pxe"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:29
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:25
msgid "Tftpd"
msgstr "Tftpd"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assign Formulas to the Branch Server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan Formula ke Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:31
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:27
msgid "Select the `Formulas` tab for the system `branch1.mystore.com`"
msgstr "Pilih tab `Formulas` untuk sistem `branch1.mystore.com`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:32
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:116
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:44
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:28
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:56
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:68
msgid "You should see list of formulas in `Configuration` sub-tab"
msgstr "Daftar formula akan ditampilkan pada subtab `Configuration`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:33
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:29
msgid "In displayed list select `Branch Network`"
msgstr "Dalam daftar yang ditampilkan, pilih `Branch Network`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:34
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:30
msgid "In displayed list select `Pxe`"
msgstr "Dalam daftar yang ditampilkan, pilih `Pxe`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:35
msgid "In displayed list select `Dhcpd`"
msgstr "Dalam daftar yang ditampilkan, pilih `Dhcpd`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:36
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:31
msgid "In displayed list select `Tftpd`"
msgstr "Dalam daftar yang ditampilkan, pilih `Tftpd`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:37
msgid "In displayed list select `Bind`"
msgstr "Dalam daftar yang ditampilkan, pilih `Bind`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:38
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:118
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:46
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:32
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:70
msgid "Save assigned formulas by clicking btn:[Save] in top right corner"
msgstr "Simpan formula yang telah ditetapkan dengan mengeklik btn:[Save] di sudut kanan atas"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:39
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configure Branch Network formula"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi formula Branch Network"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:40
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:34
msgid "Select Branch Network formula from branch server formula list"
msgstr "Pilih formula Branch Network dari daftar formula server cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Keep `Dedicated Nic` check-box selected, because we are using dedicated "
"network for terminals"
msgstr "Biarkan kotak centang `Dedicated Nic` tetap dipilih karena kita menggunakan jaringan khusus untuk terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:42
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:48
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:36
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:42
msgid "Keep the rest with default values"
msgstr "Biarkan pengaturan lainnya menggunakan nilai default"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:43
msgid ""
"In the `Terminal Naming and Identification` section edit `Branch "
"Identification` and set it to our branch id `B0001`"
msgstr "Pada bagian `Terminal Naming and Identification`, edit `Branch Identification` dan tetapkan nilainya ke ID cabang kita, yaitu `B0001`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:44
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:49
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:68
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:73
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:135
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:63
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:38
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:43
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:48
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:63
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:87
msgid "Save the formula"
msgstr "Simpan formula"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:45
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configure Pxe formula"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi formula Pxe"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:46
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:40
msgid "Select Pxe formula from branch server formula list"
msgstr "Pilih formula Pxe dari daftar formula server cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:47
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:41
msgid ""
"At the end of `Kernel Command Line Parameters` append "
"`MASTER=branch1.mystore.com`"
msgstr "Di akhir `Kernel Command Line Parameters`, tambahkan `MASTER=branch1.mystore.com`"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configure Dhcpd formula"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi formula Dhcpd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:51
msgid "Select Dhcpd formula from branch server formula list"
msgstr "Pilih formula Dhcpd dari daftar formula server cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:52
msgid "Set the `Domain Name` to the `branch1.mystore.com`"
msgstr "Tetapkan `Domain Name` ke `branch1.mystore.com`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Set the `Domain Name Server` to the IP address of branch server "
"`192.168.86.1`)"
msgstr "Tetapkan `Domain Name Server` ke alamat IP server cabang `192.168.86.1`)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Set the `Listen Interfaces` to the `eth1`, which is network interface of "
"branch server connected to dedicated terminal network"
msgstr "Tetapkan `Listen Interfaces` ke `eth1`, yaitu antarmuka jaringan server cabang yang terhubung ke jaringan khusus terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Network Configuration (subnet)` section, and use these "
"parameters for Network1:"
msgstr "Buka bagian `Network Configuration (subnet)`, lalu gunakan parameter berikut untuk Network1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:56
