"`branch1.mystore.com`, which is equal to the branch server fully qualified "
"domain name, and branch id `B0001`."
msgstr "Diasumsikan terdapat satu server cabang reguler dengan ID salt minion `branch1.mystore.com`, yang sama dengan nama domain lengkap server cabang, serta ID cabang `B0001`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This example covers two configuration methods with both of them achieving "
"same result."
msgstr "Contoh ini mencakup dua metode konfigurasi yang menghasilkan hasil yang sama."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick set up of {productname} {smr} using {smr} tools"
msgstr "Penyiapan cepat {productname} {smr} menggunakan alat {smr}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} {smr} provides command line tool `retail_branch_init`"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} menyediakan alat baris perintah `retail_branch_init`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:17
msgid "{productname} {smr} provides mass import command line tool `retail_yaml`"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} menyediakan alat baris perintah impor massal `retail_yaml`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The branch server can be configured automatically using the "
"`retail_branch_init` command, as shown in this section."
msgstr "Server cabang dapat dikonfigurasi secara otomatis menggunakan perintah `retail_branch_init`, seperti yang ditunjukkan pada bagian ini."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Branch Server Formulas With a Helper Script"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi Formula Server Cabang dengan Skrip Pembantu"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:20
msgid "Run following command on {productname} Server:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut pada Server {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"retail_branch_init branch1.mystore.com --dedicated-nic eth1 \\\n"
"                                       --branch-prefix B0001 \\\n"
"                                       --server-domain branch1.mystore.com "
"\\\n"
"                                       --branch-ip 192.168.86.1 \\\n"
"                                       --dyn-range 192.168.86.10 "
"192.168.86.250 \\\n"
"                                       --netmask 255.255.255.0\n"
msgstr ""
"retail_branch_init branch1.mystore.com --dedicated-nic eth1 \\\n"
"                                       --branch-prefix B0001 \\\n"
"                                       --server-domain branch1.mystore.com \\\n"
"                                       --branch-ip 192.168.86.1 \\\n"
"                                       --dyn-range 192.168.86.10 192.168.86.250 \\\n"
"                                       --netmask 255.255.255.0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:22
msgid "You can use the `retail_branch_init --help` command for additional options."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan perintah `retail_branch_init --help` untuk melihat opsi tambahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:23
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Verify that your changes have been configured correctly by checking the "
"{productname} {webui} branch server system formulas."
msgstr "Pastikan perubahan telah dikonfigurasi dengan benar dengan memeriksa formula sistem server cabang di {webui} {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:24
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:34
msgid "Apply highstate on the branch server."
msgstr "Terapkan highstate pada server cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:25
msgid "Similar results can be achieved by using mass import command line tool."
msgstr "Hasil serupa dapat dicapai dengan menggunakan alat baris perintah impor massal."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Branch Server Formulas With a Mass Import Tool"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi Formula Server Cabang dengan Alat Impor Massal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:27
msgid "Prepare branch specific YAML file:"
msgstr "Siapkan berkas YAML khusus cabang:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:28
msgid "For example, create `branch.yaml` file with content:"
msgstr "Sebagai contoh, buat berkas `branch.yaml` dengan isi berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"branches:\n"
"  branch1.mystore.com:\n"
"    branch_prefix: B0001\n"
"    server_domain: branch1.mystore.com\n"
"    nic: eth1\n"
"    dedicated_nic: true\n"
"    configure_firewall: true\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.86.1\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0\n"
"    dyn_range:\n"
"        - 192.168.86.10\n"
"        - 192.168.86.250\n"
msgstr ""
"branches:\n"
"  branch1.mystore.com:\n"
"    branch_prefix: B0001\n"
"    server_domain: branch1.mystore.com\n"
"    nic: eth1\n"
"    dedicated_nic: true\n"
"    configure_firewall: true\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.86.1\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0\n"
"    dyn_range:\n"
"        - 192.168.86.10\n"
"      - 192.168.86.250\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For more information about mass import tool, see "
"xref:retail:retail-mass-config.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang alat impor massal, lihat xref:retail:retail-mass-config.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:31
msgid "Import branch information from YAML file to {productname}"
msgstr "Impor informasi cabang dari berkas YAML ke {productname}"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_yaml --from-yaml branch.yaml\n"
msgstr "retail_yaml --from-yaml branch.yaml\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Both `retail_branch_init` and `retail_yaml` commands override existing "
"configuration settings of the specified branch server."
msgstr "Perintah `retail_branch_init` dan `retail_yaml` sama-sama menimpa pengaturan konfigurasi yang ada pada server cabang yang ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:36
msgid ""
"After the initial configuration done by command line tools, branch server "
"configuration can be further adjusted in {productname} {webui} through "
"branch server formulas."
msgstr "Setelah konfigurasi awal dilakukan menggunakan alat baris perintah, konfigurasi server cabang dapat disesuaikan lebih lanjut di {webui} {productname} melalui formula server cabang."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup partitioning"
msgstr "Siapkan partisi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Follow xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[] to create "
"`HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000` system group."
msgstr "Ikuti xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[] untuk membuat grup sistem `HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000`."

