#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-admin.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This sections contains notes on administering your {productname} {smr} "
"installation.  For general administration tasks, see the {productname} "
"documentation at https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi catatan tentang administrasi instalasi {productname} {smr} Anda.  Untuk tugas administrasi umum, lihat dokumentasi {productname} di https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best practices"
msgstr "Praktik terbaik"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying new images"
msgstr "Menerapkan image baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This file describes how to deploy a new image on selected terminals first, "
"test it, and then deploy it to all terminals."
msgstr "Berkas ini menjelaskan cara menerapkan image baru terlebih dahulu pada terminal tertentu, mengujinya, lalu menerapkannya ke semua terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The hardware type group (i.e. `HWTYPE` group) is used for booting new "
"terminals, while already deployed terminals can be moved to any group that "
"provides the {saltboot} formula.  This flexibility allows for testing of new "
"images or configurations."
msgstr "Grup jenis perangkat keras (yaitu grup `HWTYPE`) digunakan untuk mem-boot terminal baru, sedangkan terminal yang sudah diterapkan dapat dipindahkan ke grup mana pun yang menyediakan formula {saltboot}.  Fleksibilitas ini memungkinkan pengujian image atau konfigurasi baru."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Dual group image deployment"
msgstr "Prosedur: Penerapan image dengan dua grup"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:6
msgid "Build new image."
msgstr "Bangun image baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Use image synchronization formula to synchronize the image to all Branch "
"Servers."
msgstr "Gunakan formula sinkronisasi image untuk menyinkronkan image ke semua Server Cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:8
msgid "Create a test group."
msgstr "Buat grup pengujian."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Name the group, for example, `TEST:POSVendor-Terminal`. The name can be "
"chosen freely."
msgstr "Beri nama grup, misalnya, `TEST:POSVendor-Terminal`. Nama dapat dipilih secara bebas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Add the {saltboot} formula to this group.  Use the same configuration as in "
"the original hardware type group (`HWTYPE`), except for the image version.  "
"Use the name and version of the new image."
msgstr "Tambahkan formula {saltboot} ke grup ini.  Gunakan konfigurasi yang sama seperti pada grup jenis perangkat keras awal (`HWTYPE`), kecuali versi image.  Gunakan nama dan versi image baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:11
msgid "Move selected terminals."
msgstr "Pindahkan terminal yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:12
msgid "Identify the terminals you want to test the new image on."
msgstr "Tentukan terminal yang akan digunakan untuk menguji image baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Transfer these terminals from the group `HWTYPE:POSVendor-Terminal` group to "
"the newly created group `TEST:POSVendor-Terminal`.  It is recommended to use "
"System Set Manager for this task."
msgstr "Pindahkan terminal tersebut dari grup `HWTYPE:POSVendor-Terminal` ke grup `TEST:POSVendor-Terminal` yang baru dibuat.  Sebaiknya gunakan System Set Manager untuk tugas ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:14
msgid "Reboot terminals."
msgstr "Mulai ulang terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:15
msgid "Power on the selected POS terminals.  They should boot the new image."
msgstr "Nyalakan terminal POS yang dipilih.  Terminal tersebut seharusnya melakukan boot menggunakan image baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:16
msgid "Verify and evaluate."
msgstr "Verifikasi dan evaluasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:17
msgid "Monitor the terminals in the `TEST:POSVendor-Terminal` group."
msgstr "Pantau terminal dalam grup `TEST:POSVendor-Terminal`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Check if the new image performs as expected and if there are any issues or "
"errors encountered."
msgstr "Periksa apakah image baru berfungsi sesuai harapan dan apakah terdapat masalah atau kesalahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:19
msgid "Update `HWTYPE` group."
msgstr "Perbarui grup `HWTYPE`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Once you have confirmed that the new image works correctly, the `HWTYPE` "
"group can be updated."
msgstr "Setelah Anda memastikan bahwa image baru berfungsi dengan benar, grup `HWTYPE` dapat diperbarui."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Modify the image version in the `HWTYPE:POSVendor-Terminal` group to match "
"the tested and approved version."
msgstr "Ubah versi image dalam grup `HWTYPE:POSVendor-Terminal` agar sesuai dengan versi yang telah diuji dan disetujui."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:22
msgid "This ensures that all other terminals receive the new image."
msgstr "Hal ini memastikan bahwa semua terminal lainnya menerima image baru."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Controlling image versions"
msgstr "Mengontrol versi image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:24
msgid ""
"By default, {saltboot} formula selects the specified image name and version "
"or selects the highest one if the version is not specified."
msgstr "Secara default, formula {saltboot} memilih nama dan versi image yang ditentukan, atau memilih versi tertinggi jika versi tidak ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:25
msgid ""
"There are multiple methods to control the image version within the `HWTYPE` "
"and `TEST` groups:"
msgstr "Ada beberapa metode untuk mengontrol versi image dalam grup `HWTYPE` dan `TEST`:"

#. .Procedure: Image control
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:26
msgid "Specify exact version."
msgstr "Tentukan versi yang tepat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In both the `HWTYPE` and `TEST` groups, specify explicitly the exact version "
"of the image to be deployed."
msgstr "Dalam grup `HWTYPE` dan `TEST`, tentukan secara eksplisit versi image yang akan diterapkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:28
msgid "Make sure that the specified image version is already synchronized."
msgstr "Pastikan versi image yang ditentukan sudah disinkronkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:29
msgid "Mark new image as `Inactive`."
msgstr "Tandai image baru sebagai `Inactive`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:30
msgid "In the `HWTYPE` group, do not specify the image version."
msgstr "Dalam grup `HWTYPE`, jangan tentukan versi image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Mark the new image as `Inactive` after building and before synchronizing it "
"to Branch Server."
msgstr "Tandai image baru sebagai `Inactive` setelah dibangun dan sebelum disinkronkan ke Server Cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The `Inactive` flag ensures, that the image is not auto-selected when the "
"image version is not specified."
msgstr "Flag `Inactive` memastikan bahwa image tidak dipilih secara otomatis ketika versi image tidak ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:33
msgid ""
"After testing, remove the `Inactive` flag so the image can be auto-selected "
"in the `HWTYPE` group."
msgstr "Setelah pengujian, hapus flag `Inactive` agar image dapat dipilih secara otomatis dalam grup `HWTYPE`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The `Inactive` flag can be accessed through the API.  For more information, "
"see xref:retail:retail-image-pillars.adoc[]."
msgstr "Flag `Inactive` dapat diakses melalui API.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:retail-image-pillars.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:35
msgid "Utilize `Freeze Image` flag."
msgstr "Gunakan flag `Freeze Image`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:36
msgid "In the `HWTYPE` group, omit the image version."
msgstr "Dalam grup `HWTYPE`, jangan cantumkan versi image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Before synchronizing the new image, set the `Freeze Image` flag in "
"{saltboot} formula in `HWTYPE` group.  This ensures that the already "
"deployed terminals in this group will keep the old image."
msgstr "Sebelum menyinkronkan image baru, aktifkan flag `Freeze Image` pada formula {saltboot} dalam grup `HWTYPE`.  Hal ini memastikan bahwa terminal yang sudah diterapkan dalam grup ini tetap menggunakan image lama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:38
msgid "Synchronize and test the new image in the `TEST` group."
msgstr "Sinkronkan dan uji image baru dalam grup `TEST`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Reset the `Freeze Image` flag in `HWTYPE` group, so the terminals in this "
"group will be updated to the new image too."
msgstr "Nonaktifkan kembali flag `Freeze Image` dalam grup `HWTYPE` agar terminal dalam grup ini juga diperbarui ke image baru."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-best-practices.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Do not use the whitelist in Image Synchronization formula to control which "
"terminal boots which image.  It does not provide the required granularity "
"and does not work with containerized Branch Server."
msgstr "Jangan gunakan daftar izin dalam formula Sinkronisasi Image untuk mengontrol image yang digunakan setiap terminal saat boot.  Daftar tersebut tidak menyediakan tingkat perincian kontrol yang diperlukan dan tidak berfungsi dengan Server Cabang berbasis kontainer."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Components"
msgstr "Komponen"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} is made up of various components.  For more on how these "
"components work together, see xref:retail:retail-network-arch.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} terdiri atas berbagai komponen.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang cara komponen ini bekerja bersama, lihat xref:retail:retail-network-arch.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "The {productname} Server"
msgstr "Server {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The {productname} server contains information about infrastructure, network "
"topology, and everything required to automate image deployment and perform "
"day-to-day operations on branches and terminals.  This can include database "
"entries of registered systems, Salt pillar data for images, image "
"assignments, partitioning, network setup, network services, and more."
msgstr "Server {productname} berisi informasi tentang infrastruktur, topologi jaringan, dan semua yang diperlukan untuk mengotomatiskan penerapan image serta menjalankan operasi sehari-hari pada cabang dan terminal.  Informasi ini dapat mencakup entri basis data sistem terdaftar, data Salt pillar untuk image, penetapan image, pengaturan partisi, pengaturan jaringan, layanan jaringan, dan lainnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build Hosts"
msgstr "Host Build"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Build hosts can be arbitrary servers or virtual machines.  They are used to "
"securely build operating system images."
msgstr "Host build dapat berupa server atau mesin virtual apa pun.  Host ini digunakan untuk membangun image sistem operasi secara aman."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information on build hosts, see "
"xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang host build, lihat xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch Servers"
msgstr "Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Branch servers should be physically located close to point-of-service "
"terminals, such as in an individual store or branch office.  Branch servers "
"provide services for PXE boot, and act as an image cache, Salt broker, and "
"proxy for software components (RPM packages).  The branch server can also "
"manage local networking, and provide DHCP and DNS services."
msgstr "Server cabang sebaiknya ditempatkan secara fisik di dekat terminal point-of-service, misalnya di setiap toko atau kantor cabang.  Server cabang menyediakan layanan boot PXE dan berfungsi sebagai cache image, broker Salt, serta proxy untuk komponen perangkat lunak (paket RPM).  Server cabang juga dapat mengelola jaringan lokal serta menyediakan layanan DHCP dan DNS."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:10
msgid "For monitoring, you can install Prometheus server on the Branch servers."
msgstr "Untuk pemantauan, Anda dapat menginstal server Prometheus pada Server Cabang."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For visualization and analysis, you can install Grafana with multiple data "
"sources on a dedicated host.  For more information about Prometheus and "
"Grafana, see xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk visualisasi dan analisis, Anda dapat menginstal Grafana dengan beberapa sumber data pada host khusus.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang Prometheus dan Grafana, lihat xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Point-of-Service Terminals"
msgstr "Terminal Point-of-Service"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Point-of-Service (POS) terminals can come in many different formats, such as "
"point-of-sale terminals, kiosks, digital scales, self-service systems, and "
"reverse-vending systems.  Every terminal, however, is provided by a vendor, "
"who set basic information about the device in the firmware.  {productname} "
"{smr} accesses this vendor information to determine how best to work with "
"the terminal in use."
msgstr "Terminal Point-of-Service (POS) dapat hadir dalam berbagai bentuk, seperti terminal penjualan, kios, timbangan digital, sistem layanan mandiri, dan sistem reverse-vending.  Namun, setiap terminal disediakan oleh vendor yang menetapkan informasi dasar perangkat dalam firmware.  {productname} {smr} mengakses informasi vendor ini untuk menentukan cara terbaik menangani terminal yang digunakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In most cases, different terminals will require a different operating system "
"(OS) image to ensure they work correctly.  For example, an information kiosk "
"has a high-resolution touchscreen, where a cashier terminal might only have "
"a very basic display.  While both of these terminals require similar "
"processing and network functionality, they will require different OS "
"images.  The OS images ensure that the different display mechanisms work "
"correctly."
msgstr "Dalam sebagian besar kasus, terminal yang berbeda memerlukan image sistem operasi (OS) yang berbeda agar dapat berfungsi dengan benar.  Misalnya, kios informasi memiliki layar sentuh beresolusi tinggi, sedangkan terminal kasir mungkin hanya memiliki layar yang sangat sederhana.  Meskipun kedua terminal ini memerlukan fungsi pemrosesan dan jaringan yang serupa, keduanya memerlukan image OS yang berbeda.  Image OS memastikan bahwa mekanisme tampilan yang berbeda tersebut berfungsi dengan benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:15
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} supports POS terminals that boot using both BIOS and "
"UEFI.  For UEFI booting terminals, you will need to configure the EFI "
"partition in the {saltboot} formula.  For more information on EFI in the "
"{saltboot} formula, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} mendukung terminal POS yang melakukan boot menggunakan BIOS maupun UEFI.  Untuk terminal yang melakukan boot menggunakan UEFI, Anda perlu mengonfigurasi partisi EFI dalam formula {saltboot}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang EFI dalam formula {saltboot}, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fitting It All Together"
msgstr "Mengintegrasikan Semua Komponen"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:17
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} uses the same technology as {productname}, but is "
"customized to address the needs of retail organizations."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} menggunakan teknologi yang sama dengan {productname}, tetapi disesuaikan untuk memenuhi kebutuhan organisasi ritel."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Types"
msgstr "Jenis Perangkat Keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Because every environment is different, and can contain many different "
"configurations of many different terminals, {productname} {smr} uses "
"hardware types to simplify device management."
msgstr "Karena setiap lingkungan berbeda dan dapat mencakup beragam konfigurasi dari berbagai terminal, {productname} {smr} menggunakan jenis perangkat keras untuk menyederhanakan pengelolaan perangkat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Hardware types allow you to group devices according to manufacturer and "
"device name.  Then all devices of a particular type can be managed as one."
msgstr "Jenis perangkat keras memungkinkan Anda mengelompokkan perangkat berdasarkan produsen dan nama perangkat.  Dengan demikian, semua perangkat dari jenis tertentu dapat dikelola sebagai satu kesatuan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch System Groups"
msgstr "Grup Sistem Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:22
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} uses system groups to organize the various devices in "
"your environment."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} menggunakan grup sistem untuk mengatur berbagai perangkat di lingkungan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Each branch requires a system group, containing a single branch server, and "
"the POS terminals associated with that server.  Each system group is "
"identified with a Branch ID.  The Branch ID is used in formulas and scripts "
"to automatically update the entire group."
msgstr "Setiap cabang memerlukan grup sistem yang berisi satu server cabang dan terminal POS yang terkait dengan server tersebut.  Setiap grup sistem diidentifikasi dengan ID Cabang.  ID Cabang digunakan dalam formula dan skrip untuk memperbarui seluruh grup secara otomatis."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Formulas"
msgstr "Formula Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:25
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} uses Salt formulas to help simplify configuration.  "
"Formulas are pre-written Salt states, that are used to configure your "
"installation."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} menggunakan formula Salt untuk membantu menyederhanakan konfigurasi.  Formula adalah state Salt yang telah ditulis sebelumnya dan digunakan untuk mengonfigurasi instalasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You can use formulas to apply configuration patterns to your hardware "
"groups.  {productname} {smr} uses the {saltboot} formula, which defines "
"partitioning and OS images for terminals."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan formula untuk menerapkan pola konfigurasi pada grup perangkat keras Anda.  {productname} {smr} menggunakan formula {saltboot}, yang menentukan pengaturan partisi dan image OS untuk terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:27
msgid ""
"You can use default settings for formulas, or edit them to make them more "
"specific to your environment."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan pengaturan default formula atau mengeditnya agar lebih sesuai dengan lingkungan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For more information about formulas, see "
"xref:retail:retail-formulas-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula, lihat xref:retail:retail-formulas-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cobbler"
msgstr "Cobbler"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:30
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} uses Cobbler to manage and prepare boot configuration "
"for the POS terminals."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} menggunakan Cobbler untuk mengelola dan menyiapkan konfigurasi boot bagi terminal POS."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "{saltboot}"
msgstr "{saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:32
msgid ""
"{saltboot} is a collection of tools and processes that are used to "
"bootstrap, deploy and validate {productname} {smr} terminals."
msgstr "{saltboot} adalah kumpulan alat dan proses yang digunakan untuk melakukan bootstrap, menerapkan, dan memvalidasi terminal {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:33
msgid "{saltboot} consists of:"
msgstr "{saltboot} terdiri atas:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:34
msgid "Initialization:"
msgstr "Inisialisasi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The {saltboot} `initrd` is created during image building and is required for "
"bootstrapping terminals."
msgstr "`initrd` {saltboot} dibuat selama proses pembangunan image dan diperlukan untuk melakukan bootstrap terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:36
msgid "{saltboot} state:"
msgstr "State {saltboot}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:37
msgid "The Salt state that contains the logic for the entire {saltboot} process."
msgstr "State Salt yang berisi logika untuk seluruh proses {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:38
msgid "Partitioning pillars:"
msgstr "Pillar pengaturan partisi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:39
msgid ""
"The Salt pillar structure that describes how terminals are partitioned and "
"what image is deployed on each terminal."
msgstr "Struktur Salt pillar yang menjelaskan pengaturan partisi terminal dan image yang diterapkan pada setiap terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:40
msgid "Images and boot images pillars:"
msgstr "Pillar image dan image boot:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:41
msgid ""
"When the image building feature in {productname} successfully builds an "
"image that contains the {saltboot} `initrd`, the image and boot image Salt "
"pillars are created."
msgstr "Ketika fitur pembangunan image di {productname} berhasil membangun image yang berisi `initrd` {saltboot}, Salt pillar untuk image dan image boot dibuat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:42
msgid ""
"The {saltboot} process involves the {productname} Server, a terminal running "
"the {saltboot} `initrd`, and the branch server providing the {saltboot} "
"services to the terminal."
msgstr "Proses {saltboot} melibatkan Server {productname}, terminal yang menjalankan `initrd` {saltboot}, dan server cabang yang menyediakan layanan {saltboot} bagi terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-components.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For a detailed diagram explaining how the {saltboot} boot process works, see "
"xref:retail:retail-saltboot-diagram.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk diagram terperinci yang menjelaskan cara kerja proses boot {saltboot}, lihat xref:retail:retail-saltboot-diagram.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delta Images"
msgstr "Image Delta"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you have very large images that you need to synchronize to the branch "
"server, you can use delta images to save network bandwidth."
msgstr "Jika Anda memiliki image berukuran sangat besar yang perlu disinkronkan ke server cabang, Anda dapat menggunakan image delta untuk menghemat bandwidth jaringan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:3
msgid ""
"A delta image contains only the differences between two regular images.  If "
"there are only a few changes between two images, the delta image can be very "
"small.  Synchronizing a delta image to the branch consumes less network "
"bandwidth but it requires some extra hardware resources on the branch server "
"to rebuild the installable image."
msgstr "Image delta hanya berisi perbedaan antara dua image reguler.  Jika hanya ada sedikit perubahan di antara kedua image, ukuran image delta dapat sangat kecil.  Menyinkronkan image delta ke cabang menggunakan lebih sedikit bandwidth jaringan, tetapi memerlukan sumber daya perangkat keras tambahan pada server cabang untuk membangun kembali image yang dapat diinstal."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building Delta Images"
msgstr "Membangun Image Delta"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The `retail_create_delta` tool creates a delta image on the {productname} "
"server.  The tool uses `xdelta3` internally."
msgstr "Alat `retail_create_delta` membuat image delta pada server {productname}.  Alat ini menggunakan `xdelta3` secara internal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Use the name and the version strings of the target and the source image as "
"parameters to the command.  The format of the parameters must be "
"`<NAME>-<VERSION>` and they must correspond to the image names and versions "
"available in the pillar.  For example, if the pillar contains:"
msgstr "Gunakan nama dan string versi image target serta image sumber sebagai parameter perintah.  Format parameter harus berupa `<NAME>-<VERSION>` dan harus sesuai dengan nama serta versi image yang tersedia dalam pillar.  Misalnya, jika pillar berisi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"images:\n"
"  POS_Image_JeOS6:\n"
"    6.0.0:\n"
"      ...\n"
"    6.0.1:\n"
"      ...\n"
"  POS_Image_Graphical6:\n"
"    6.0.0:\n"
"      ...\n"
msgstr ""
"images:\n"
"  POS_Image_JeOS6:\n"
"    6.0.0:\n"
"      ...\n"
"    6.0.1:\n"
"      ...\n"
"  POS_Image_Graphical6:\n"
"    6.0.0:\n"
"      ...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:8
msgid "Then the `retail_create_delta` command is:"
msgstr "Maka perintah `retail_create_delta` adalah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_create_delta POS_Image_JeOS6-6.0.1 POS_Image_JeOS6-6.0.0\n"
msgstr "retail_create_delta POS_Image_JeOS6-6.0.1 POS_Image_JeOS6-6.0.0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:10
msgid ""
"This command will generate the delta image between version 6.0.0 and version "
"6.0.1.  The resulting delta file is saved in `/srv/www/os-images` and the "
"corresponding pillar in the database."
msgstr "Perintah ini akan menghasilkan image delta antara versi 6.0.0 dan versi 6.0.1.  Berkas delta yang dihasilkan disimpan di `/srv/www/os-images` dan pillar terkait disimpan dalam basis data."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning Delta Generation"
msgstr "Menyesuaikan Pembuatan Delta"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Performance tuning is possible with the `-B <VALUE>` option, which is passed "
"to `xdelta3`.  With higher values you achieve smaller deltas at the cost of "
"higher memory requirements.  For more information, see the `xdelta3` "
"documentation (`man xdelta3`)."
msgstr "Penyesuaian kinerja dapat dilakukan dengan opsi `-B <VALUE>`, yang diteruskan ke `xdelta3`.  Nilai yang lebih tinggi menghasilkan delta yang lebih kecil, tetapi membutuhkan lebih banyak memori.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat dokumentasi `xdelta3` (`man xdelta3`)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Synchronizing to the Branch Server"
msgstr "Sinkronisasi Image ke Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-delta-images.adoc:14
msgid ""
"When an image is synchronized to the branch server, the `image-sync-formula` "
"first checks whether the source image is available on the branch server.  "
"Only if the source image is available, the delta will be downloaded to save "
"network bandwidth."
msgstr "Saat image disinkronkan ke server cabang, `image-sync-formula` terlebih dahulu memeriksa apakah image sumber tersedia pada server cabang.  Delta hanya akan diunduh jika image sumber tersedia, untuk menghemat bandwidth jaringan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-section.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying Terminals"
msgstr "Menerapkan Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-section.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers how to integrate terminals into your {productname} {smr} "
"environment.  You can prepare the {productname} {smr} installation for image "
"deployment.  Finally, you can deploy terminals using network boot and other "
"methods."
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas cara mengintegrasikan terminal ke lingkungan {productname} {smr} Anda.  Anda dapat menyiapkan instalasi {productname} {smr} untuk penerapan image.  Setelah itu, Anda dapat menerapkan terminal menggunakan boot jaringan dan metode lainnya."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy Terminals and Auto-Accept Keys"
msgstr "Menerapkan Terminal dan Menerima Kunci Secara Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can configure {productname} to automatically accept the keys of newly "
"deployed terminals.  This is achieved using {salt} grains."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengonfigurasi {productname} agar secara otomatis menerima kunci terminal yang baru diterapkan.  Hal ini dilakukan menggunakan grain {salt}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Automatically accepting keys is less secure than manually checking and "
"accepting keys.  Only use this method on trusted networks."
msgstr "Menerima kunci secara otomatis kurang aman dibandingkan memeriksa dan menerima kunci secara manual.  Gunakan metode ini hanya pada jaringan tepercaya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:4
msgid "There are three different ways you can configure auto-signed grains:"
msgstr "Ada tiga cara untuk mengonfigurasi grain yang ditandatangani secara otomatis:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Configure {saltboot} to send automatically signed grains once and then "
"delete them.  To do this, append the {saltboot} configuration to an existing "
"`initrd`.  For more information, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc#retail.deployterminals.auto.once[]."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan {saltboot} untuk mengirim grain yang ditandatangani secara otomatis satu kali, lalu menghapusnya.  Untuk melakukannya, tambahkan konfigurasi {saltboot} ke `initrd` yang sudah ada.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc#retail.deployterminals.auto.once[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Choose to keep the automatically signed grains on the {salt} client.  To do "
"this, include the configuration file in the image source before the client "
"image is built.  After booting, the auto-signed grain is stored on the "
"client as a regular Salt grain.  For more information, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc#retail.deployterminals.auto.keep[]."
msgstr "Pilih untuk menyimpan grain yang ditandatangani secara otomatis pada klien {salt}.  Untuk melakukannya, sertakan berkas konfigurasi dalam sumber image sebelum image klien dibangun.  Setelah boot, grain yang ditandatangani secara otomatis disimpan pada klien sebagai grain Salt reguler.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc#retail.deployterminals.auto.keep[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Configure {saltboot} during PXE boot using kernel parameters.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc#retail.deployterminals.auto.pxe[]."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan {saltboot} selama boot PXE menggunakan parameter kernel.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc#retail.deployterminals.auto.pxe[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:8
msgid ""
"When you have configured {saltboot} using one of these methods, you need to "
"configure the {productname} Server to accept them.  For more information, "
"see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc#retail.deployterminals.auto.server[]."
msgstr "Setelah mengonfigurasi {saltboot} menggunakan salah satu metode ini, Anda perlu mengonfigurasi Server {productname} untuk menerimanya.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc#retail.deployterminals.auto.server[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the server to auto-accept"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi server agar menerima kunci secara otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When you have configured {saltboot} using one of these methods, you need to "
"configure the server to accept them.  The server stores the autosign keys in "
"a file within the `/etc/salt/master.d/` directory, which is preserved in "
"`etc-salt` volume.  You can enable auto-signing by creating an auto-sign "
"file that contains the key you created when you configured {saltboot}."
msgstr "Setelah mengonfigurasi {saltboot} menggunakan salah satu metode ini, Anda perlu mengonfigurasi server untuk menerimanya.  Server menyimpan kunci autosign dalam berkas di direktori `/etc/salt/master.d/`, yang dipertahankan dalam volume `etc-salt`.  Anda dapat mengaktifkan penandatanganan otomatis dengan membuat berkas penandatanganan otomatis yang berisi kunci yang Anda buat saat mengonfigurasi {saltboot}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the server to auto-accept"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi server agar menerima kunci secara otomatis"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:12
msgid ""
"At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, enter "
"the server container:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah host kontainer {productname}, sebagai root, masuk ke kontainer server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:14
msgid "Inside the container, execute the following steps:"
msgstr "Di dalam kontainer, jalankan langkah-langkah berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In directory `/etc/salt/master.d/`, create file `autosign_grains.conf` and "
"specify `autosign_grains_dir`:"
msgstr "Di direktori `/etc/salt/master.d/`, buat berkas `autosign_grains.conf` dan tentukan `autosign_grains_dir`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo \"autosign_grains_dir: /etc/salt/autosign_grains\" \\\n"
"  > /etc/salt/master.d/autosign_grains.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"echo \"autosign_grains_dir: /etc/salt/autosign_grains\" \\\n"
"  > /etc/salt/master.d/autosign_grains.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Create a file at `/etc/salt/autosign_grains/autosign_key`, that contains the "
"auto-sign key you specified with {saltboot} (replace `<AUTOSIGN_KEY>` with "
"the key:"
msgstr "Buat berkas di `/etc/salt/autosign_grains/autosign_key` yang berisi kunci penandatanganan otomatis yang Anda tentukan melalui {saltboot} (ganti `<AUTOSIGN_KEY>` dengan kunci tersebut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir /etc/salt/autosign_grains\n"
"echo \"<AUTOSIGN_KEY>\" > /etc/salt/autosign_grains/autosign_key\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir /etc/salt/autosign_grains\n"
"echo \"<AUTOSIGN_KEY>\" > /etc/salt/autosign_grains/autosign_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:19
msgid "For multiple keys, put each one on a new line."
msgstr "Untuk beberapa kunci, tempatkan setiap kunci pada baris baru."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring the server to automatically accept "
"grains, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/autoaccept_grains.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang konfigurasi server agar menerima grain secara otomatis, lihat https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/autoaccept_grains.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {saltboot} to keep auto-signed grains"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi {saltboot} untuk menyimpan grain yang ditandatangani secara otomatis"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:22
msgid "Use different procedure for SLE 15 and SLE 12."
msgstr "Gunakan prosedur yang berbeda untuk SLE 15 dan SLE 12."

#.  For SLE15 templates, the procedure is the following:
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring {saltboot} to keep auto-signed grains (SLE 15)"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi {saltboot} untuk menyimpan grain yang ditandatangani secara otomatis (SLE 15)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the location where the image source is built, such as a build host or "
"source repository, create a configuration file called "
"`etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/autosign-grains.conf`."
msgstr "Di lokasi tempat sumber image dibangun, seperti host build atau repositori sumber, buat berkas konfigurasi bernama `etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/autosign-grains.conf`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:25
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Edit the new configuration file with these details.  You can use any value "
"you like as the auto-sign key:"
msgstr "Edit berkas konfigurasi baru tersebut dengan rincian berikut.  Anda dapat menggunakan nilai apa pun sebagai kunci penandatanganan otomatis:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:26
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# create the grain\n"
"grains:\n"
"    autosign_key: <AUTOSIGN_KEY>\n"
msgstr ""
"# buat grain\n"
"grains:\n"
"    autosign_key: <AUTOSIGN_KEY>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:27
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# send the grain as part of auth request\n"
"autosign_grains:\n"
"    - autosign_key\n"
msgstr ""
"# kirim grain sebagai bagian dari permintaan autentikasi\n"
"autosign_grains:\n"
"    - autosign_key\n"

#.  For SLE12 and SLE11 templates, the procedure is the following:
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring {saltboot} to keep auto-signed grains (SLE 12)"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi {saltboot} untuk menyimpan grain yang ditandatangani secara otomatis (SLE 12)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the location where the image source is built, such as a build host or "
"source repository, create a configuration file called "
"`etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/autosign-grains.conf`.  This must be outside "
"of the `root` directory provided by the template.  This way you prevent the "
"inclusion of unwanted files in the `initrd`."
msgstr "Di lokasi tempat sumber image dibangun, seperti host build atau repositori sumber, buat berkas konfigurasi bernama `etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/autosign-grains.conf`.  Berkas ini harus berada di luar direktori `root` yang disediakan oleh templat.  Dengan cara ini, Anda mencegah penyertaan berkas yang tidak diinginkan dalam `initrd`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:33
msgid "Create a tarball of this directory:"
msgstr "Buat arsip tar dari direktori ini:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "tar -czf autosign-grains.tgz etc\n"
msgstr "tar -czf autosign-grains.tgz etc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Edit the `config.xml` template file.  In the `<packages type=\"image\">` "
"element, add:"
msgstr "Edit berkas templat `config.xml`.  Pada elemen `<packages type=\"image\">`, tambahkan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "<archive name=\"autosign.tgz\" bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
msgstr "<archive name=\"autosign.tgz\" bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:37
msgid "Save the file and rebuild the image."
msgstr "Simpan berkas dan bangun ulang image."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {saltboot} to auto-sign during PXE boot"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi {saltboot} untuk melakukan penandatanganan otomatis selama boot PXE"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring {saltboot} to auto-sign during PXE boot"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi {saltboot} untuk melakukan penandatanganan otomatis selama boot PXE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:40
msgid "Configure the PXE formula to specify these kernel parameters during booting:"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan formula PXE untuk menentukan parameter kernel berikut selama boot:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "SALT_AUTOSIGN_GRAINS=autosign_key:<AUTOSIGN_KEY>\n"
msgstr "SALT_AUTOSIGN_GRAINS=autosign_key:<AUTOSIGN_KEY>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-auto.adoc:42
msgid ""
"PXE boot the {salt} client.  The formula creates the "
"`./etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/autosign-grains-onetime.conf` configuration "
"file and passes it to `initrd`."
msgstr "Jalankan boot PXE pada klien {salt}.  Formula membuat berkas konfigurasi `./etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/autosign-grains-onetime.conf` dan meneruskannya ke `initrd`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy Terminals - Other Methods"
msgstr "Menerapkan Terminal - Metode Lain"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are not able to boot terminals from the network, you can create a "
"live USB image and deploy terminals using a removable USB storage device.  "
"You can also bootstrap terminals across a wireless network."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak dapat melakukan boot terminal melalui jaringan, Anda dapat membuat image live USB dan menerapkan terminal menggunakan perangkat penyimpanan USB yang dapat dilepas.  Anda juga dapat melakukan bootstrap terminal melalui jaringan nirkabel."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Hardware type groups must be created and images must be synchronized before "
"continuing.  For more information, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."
msgstr "Grup jenis perangkat keras harus dibuat dan image harus disinkronkan sebelum melanjutkan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:4
msgid ""
"After you have registered new terminals, always check the {productname} "
"{webui} to ensure your terminals have connected successfully to the branch "
"server, and not directly to the {productname} Server by mistake."
msgstr "Setelah mendaftarkan terminal baru, selalu periksa {webui} {productname} untuk memastikan terminal berhasil terhubung ke server cabang, bukan secara keliru terhubung langsung ke Server {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy Terminals with a Removable USB Device"
msgstr "Menerapkan Terminal dengan Perangkat USB yang Dapat Dilepas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you do not want to boot terminals from the network, you can create a live "
"USB image and deploy terminals using a removable USB storage device.  This "
"is useful if you cannot boot your terminals from the network, or if you do "
"not have a local {productname} {smr} branch server providing network "
"services."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak ingin melakukan boot terminal melalui jaringan, Anda dapat membuat image live USB dan menerapkan terminal menggunakan perangkat penyimpanan USB yang dapat dilepas.  Cara ini berguna jika Anda tidak dapat melakukan boot terminal melalui jaringan, atau jika Anda tidak memiliki server cabang {productname} {smr} lokal yang menyediakan layanan jaringan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can prepare a bootable USB device with the image and tools required to "
"deploy a POS terminal using a remote {productname} {smr} branch server.  You "
"can create the bootable USB device on the branch server directly, or on the "
"{productname} {smr} Server."
msgstr "Anda dapat menyiapkan perangkat USB yang dapat di-boot dengan image dan alat yang diperlukan untuk menerapkan terminal POS menggunakan server cabang {productname} {smr} jarak jauh.  Anda dapat membuat perangkat USB yang dapat di-boot langsung pada server cabang atau pada Server {productname} {smr}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:8
msgid ""
"POS devices booted using the USB device are assigned to the {productname} "
"{smr} branch server that created the USB device."
msgstr "Perangkat POS yang di-boot menggunakan perangkat USB ditetapkan ke server cabang {productname} {smr} yang membuat perangkat USB tersebut."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Bootable USB Device"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Perangkat USB yang Dapat Di-boot"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On the {productname} {smr} branch server, at the command prompt, as root, "
"create the POS image."
msgstr "Pada server cabang {productname} {smr}, di prompt perintah, sebagai root, buat image POS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:11
msgid "You need to specify the size of the image, in megabytes."
msgstr "Anda perlu menentukan ukuran image dalam megabita."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:12
msgid "Ensure you allow at least 300{nbsp}MB:"
msgstr "Pastikan Anda menyediakan setidaknya 300{nbsp}MB:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-call image_sync_usb.create <usb image name> <size in MB>\n"
msgstr "salt-call image_sync_usb.create <usb image name> <size in MB>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Insert the USB device into the {productname} {smr} branch server machine, "
"and copy the image to the new location:"
msgstr "Masukkan perangkat USB ke mesin server cabang {productname} {smr}, lalu salin image ke lokasi baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "dd bs=1M if=<usb image name> of=<path to usb device>\n"
msgstr "dd bs=1M if=<usb image name> of=<path to usb device>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When you have the image on the USB drive, check that the terminals you want "
"to deploy allow local booting.  You can check this by editing the {saltboot} "
"formula in the {productname} {smr} {webui}.  For more information about the "
"{saltboot} formula, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "Setelah image tersimpan pada drive USB, pastikan terminal yang ingin Anda terapkan mengizinkan boot lokal.  Anda dapat memeriksanya dengan mengedit formula {saltboot} di {webui} {productname} {smr}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula {saltboot}, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying Images to the Terminals using USB"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menerapkan Image ke Terminal menggunakan USB"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:18
msgid "Insert the USB device into the terminal."
msgstr "Masukkan perangkat USB ke terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:19
msgid "Power on the POS terminal."
msgstr "Nyalakan terminal POS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:20
msgid "Boot from the USB device to begin bootstrapping."
msgstr "Lakukan boot dari perangkat USB untuk memulai bootstrap."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy Terminals over a Wireless Network"
msgstr "Menerapkan Terminal melalui Jaringan Nirkabel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For terminals that cannot be connected directly to the physical network, you "
"can deploy them over a wireless network.  Wireless networks do not support "
"PXE booting, so you must perform the initial booting and initialization of "
"the wireless connection on the terminal using a USB device."
msgstr "Untuk terminal yang tidak dapat dihubungkan langsung ke jaringan fisik, Anda dapat menerapkannya melalui jaringan nirkabel.  Jaringan nirkabel tidak mendukung boot PXE, sehingga Anda harus melakukan boot awal dan inisialisasi koneksi nirkabel pada terminal menggunakan perangkat USB."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:23
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For more information about using USB devices to boot, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan perangkat USB untuk boot, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping across a wireless network could expose a security risk if you "
"are using encrypted OS images.  The boot `initrd` image and the partition "
"that contains `/etc/venv-salt-minion` must be stored unencrypted on the "
"terminal.  This allows {productname} {smr} to set up the wireless network.  "
"If this breaches your security requirements, you will need to use a separate "
"production network, with network credentials managed by Salt, so that "
"credentials are not stored on the terminal unencrypted."
msgstr "Bootstrap melalui jaringan nirkabel dapat menimbulkan risiko keamanan jika Anda menggunakan image OS terenkripsi.  Image boot `initrd` dan partisi yang berisi `/etc/venv-salt-minion` harus disimpan tanpa enkripsi pada terminal.  Hal ini memungkinkan {productname} {smr} menyiapkan jaringan nirkabel.  Jika hal ini melanggar persyaratan keamanan Anda, gunakan jaringan produksi terpisah dengan kredensial jaringan yang dikelola oleh Salt agar kredensial tidak disimpan tanpa enkripsi pada terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to have created a bootable USB device.  Ensure "
"that the OS image you use to create the USB device has the `dracut-wireless` "
"package included.  For more information about using USB devices to boot, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc[]."
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, Anda harus sudah membuat perangkat USB yang dapat di-boot.  Pastikan image OS yang digunakan untuk membuat perangkat USB menyertakan paket `dracut-wireless`.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan perangkat USB untuk boot, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:26
msgid ""
"When you have created the USB device, you need to provide the wireless "
"credentials to the terminal.  You can do this in a number of ways:"
msgstr "Setelah membuat perangkat USB, Anda perlu menyediakan kredensial jaringan nirkabel untuk terminal.  Anda dapat melakukannya dengan beberapa cara:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:27
msgid "Directly during image build."
msgstr "Secara langsung selama pembangunan image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:28
msgid "Add it to the `initrd` file on the branch server."
msgstr "Menambahkannya ke berkas `initrd` pada server cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:29
msgid "During terminal booting, using the kernel command line."
msgstr "Selama boot terminal, menggunakan baris perintah kernel."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Providing Wireless Credentials During Image Build"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyediakan Kredensial Jaringan Nirkabel Selama Pembangunan Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:31
msgid "Ensure that the `dracut-wireless` package is included in the image template."
msgstr "Pastikan paket `dracut-wireless` disertakan dalam templat image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Set the wireless credentials by creating or editing the "
"`etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0` file to the image template, with these "
"details:"
msgstr "Tetapkan kredensial jaringan nirkabel dengan membuat atau mengedit berkas `etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0` dalam templat image, dengan rincian berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:33
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# ALLOW_UPDATE_FROM_INITRD\n"
"WIRELESS_ESSID=<wireless network name>\n"
"WIRELESS_WPA_PSK=<wireless network password>\n"
msgstr ""
"# ALLOW_UPDATE_FROM_INITRD\n"
"WIRELESS_ESSID=<wireless network name>\n"
"WIRELESS_WPA_PSK=<wireless network password>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:34
msgid ""
"If you want to use different credentials for bootstrapping to what is used "
"during normal operation, you can remove the `ALLOW_UPDATE_FROM_INITRD` line."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin menggunakan kredensial untuk bootstrap yang berbeda dari kredensial untuk operasi normal, Anda dapat menghapus baris `ALLOW_UPDATE_FROM_INITRD`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:35
msgid "Build the image."
msgstr "Bangun image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:36
msgid "Prepare a USB device using this image, and boot the terminal."
msgstr "Siapkan perangkat USB menggunakan image ini, lalu lakukan boot terminal."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Providing Wireless Credentials with initrd"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyediakan Kredensial Jaringan Nirkabel dengan initrd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Set the wireless credentials by creating or editing the "
"`etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0` file, with these details:"
msgstr "Tetapkan kredensial jaringan nirkabel dengan membuat atau mengedit berkas `etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0`, dengan rincian berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:41
msgid ". Copy the file to `initrd` on the branch server:"
msgstr ". Salin berkas ke `initrd` pada server cabang:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo ./etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0 | cpio -H newc -o | gzip >> "
"/srv/saltboot/boot/initrd.gz\n"
msgstr "echo ./etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0 | cpio -H newc -o | gzip >> /srv/saltboot/boot/initrd.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Check that the terminals you want to deploy allow local booting.  You can "
"check this by editing the {saltboot} formula in the {productname} {smr} "
"{webui}.  For more information about the {saltboot} formula, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "Pastikan terminal yang ingin Anda terapkan mengizinkan boot lokal.  Anda dapat memeriksanya dengan mengedit formula {saltboot} di {webui} {productname} {smr}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula {saltboot}, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Providing Wireless Credentials During Terminal Boot"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyediakan Kredensial Jaringan Nirkabel Selama Boot Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:45
msgid "Mount the USB device on the terminal, and boot from it."
msgstr "Pasang perangkat USB pada terminal, lalu lakukan boot dari perangkat tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:46
msgid "Append these commands to the kernel boot parameters:"
msgstr "Tambahkan perintah berikut ke parameter boot kernel:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"WIRELESS_ESSID=<wireless_network_name>\n"
"WIRELESS_WPA_PSK=<wireless_network_password>\n"
msgstr ""
"WIRELESS_ESSID=<wireless_network_name>\n"
"WIRELESS_WPA_PSK=<wireless_network_password>\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change Wireless Credentials"
msgstr "Mengubah Kredensial Jaringan Nirkabel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:49
msgid ""
"After you have set the wireless credentials, you can change them as needed.  "
"The way to do this is different if you use one company-wide network, or if "
"you have each branch server on its own separate network."
msgstr "Setelah menetapkan kredensial jaringan nirkabel, Anda dapat mengubahnya sesuai kebutuhan.  Caranya berbeda tergantung pada apakah Anda menggunakan satu jaringan untuk seluruh perusahaan atau jaringan terpisah untuk setiap server cabang."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Changing Wireless Credentials for Single Network"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengubah Kredensial Jaringan Nirkabel untuk Satu Jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:51
msgid "Rebuild the boot image with updated credentials."
msgstr "Bangun ulang image boot dengan kredensial yang diperbarui."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:52
msgid "Recreate the bootable USB device based on the new boot image."
msgstr "Buat ulang perangkat USB yang dapat di-boot berdasarkan image boot baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:53
msgid "Boot terminal from new USB device."
msgstr "Lakukan boot terminal dari perangkat USB baru."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Changing Wireless Credentials for Multiple Networks"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengubah Kredensial Jaringan Nirkabel untuk Beberapa Jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:55
msgid ""
"In the `/srv/salt/` directory, create a salt state called "
"`update-terminal-credentials.sls`, and enter the new wireless network "
"credentials:"
msgstr "Di direktori `/srv/salt/`, buat state Salt bernama `update-terminal-credentials.sls`, lalu masukkan kredensial jaringan nirkabel baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"   - contents: |\n"
"        WIRELESS_ESSID=<wireless_network_name>\n"
"        WIRELESS_WPA_PSK=<wireless_network_password>\n"
"# regenerate initrd\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"  - name: 'mkinitrd'\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"   - contents: |\n"
"        WIRELESS_ESSID=<wireless_network_name>\n"
"        WIRELESS_WPA_PSK=<wireless_network_password>\n"
"# regenerate initrd\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"  - name: 'mkinitrd'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:57
msgid "Apply the Salt state to the terminal:"
msgstr "Terapkan state Salt pada terminal:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt <terminal_salt_name> state.apply update-terminal-credentials\n"
msgstr "salt <terminal_salt_name> state.apply update-terminal-credentials\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:59
msgid ""
"If you are using a separate network for the boot phase, the managed file "
"might need to be renamed, or extended to "
"`/etc/sysconfig/network/initrd-ifcfg-wlan0`."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan jaringan terpisah untuk tahap boot, berkas yang dikelola mungkin perlu diganti namanya atau jalurnya diperluas menjadi `/etc/sysconfig/network/initrd-ifcfg-wlan0`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Multiple Wireless Networks"
msgstr "Menggunakan Beberapa Jaringan Nirkabel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:61
msgid ""
"You can configure terminals to use a different set of wireless credentials "
"during the boot process, to what they use during normal operation."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengonfigurasi terminal agar menggunakan kredensial jaringan nirkabel selama proses boot yang berbeda dari kredensial yang digunakan selama operasi normal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:62
msgid ""
"If you provide wireless credentials using `initrd` files, you can create two "
"different files, one for use during boot called `initrd-ifcfg-wlan0`, and "
"the other for use during normal operation, called `ifcfg-wlan0`."
msgstr "Jika Anda menyediakan kredensial jaringan nirkabel menggunakan berkas `initrd`, Anda dapat membuat dua berkas berbeda: satu untuk digunakan selama boot, bernama `initrd-ifcfg-wlan0`, dan satu lagi untuk digunakan selama operasi normal, bernama `ifcfg-wlan0`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use custom Salt states to manage wireless credentials "
"with `saltboot-hook`."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat menggunakan state Salt khusus untuk mengelola kredensial jaringan nirkabel dengan `saltboot-hook`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:64
msgid ""
"First of all, you need to set the wireless details for normal operation.  "
"This will become the default settings.  Then you can specify a second Salt "
"state with the wireless details for use during the boot procedure."
msgstr "Pertama, Anda perlu menetapkan rincian jaringan nirkabel untuk operasi normal.  Rincian ini akan menjadi pengaturan default.  Kemudian, Anda dapat menentukan state Salt kedua dengan rincian jaringan nirkabel untuk digunakan selama prosedur boot."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using Different Wireless Credentials for Production Network"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menggunakan Kredensial Jaringan Nirkabel yang Berbeda untuk Jaringan Produksi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Write a custom Salt state named `/srv/salt/saltboot_hook.sls` containing the "
"wireless details for normal operation."
msgstr "Tulis state Salt khusus bernama `/srv/salt/saltboot_hook.sls` yang berisi rincian jaringan nirkabel untuk operasi normal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:67
msgid "This Salt state is applied by {saltboot} after the system image is deployed."
msgstr "State Salt ini diterapkan oleh {saltboot} setelah image sistem diterapkan."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% set root = salt['environ.get']('NEWROOT') %}\n"
"{{ root }}/etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"   - contents: |\n"
"        WIRELESS_ESSID=<wireless_network_name>\n"
"        WIRELESS_WPA_PSK=<wireless_network_password>\n"
"    - require:\n"
"      - saltboot: saltboot_fstab\n"
"    - require_in:\n"
"      - saltboot: boot_system\n"
msgstr ""
"{% set root = salt['environ.get']('NEWROOT') %}\n"
"{{ root }}/etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-wlan0:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"   - contents: |\n"
"        WIRELESS_ESSID=<wireless_network_name>\n"
"        WIRELESS_WPA_PSK=<wireless_network_password>\n"
"    - require:\n"
"      - saltboot: saltboot_fstab\n"
"    - require_in:\n"
"      - saltboot: boot_system\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc:69
msgid ""
"The boot phase supports only WPA2 PSK wireless configuration.  Salt-managed "
"production configuration supports all features supported by all major "
"operating systems."
msgstr "Tahap boot hanya mendukung konfigurasi jaringan nirkabel WPA2 PSK.  Konfigurasi produksi yang dikelola Salt mendukung semua fitur yang didukung oleh semua sistem operasi utama."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment basics"
msgstr "Dasar-dasar penerapan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When you have the {productname} Server and Branch Server set up, you are "
"ready to deploy point-of-service terminals by following these steps:"
msgstr "Setelah Server {productname} dan Server Cabang disiapkan, Anda dapat menerapkan terminal point-of-service dengan mengikuti langkah-langkah berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:3
msgid "Create hardware type groups"
msgstr "Buat grup jenis perangkat keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:4
msgid "Assign and configure the {saltboot} formula for each hardware type group"
msgstr "Tetapkan dan konfigurasikan formula {saltboot} untuk setiap grup jenis perangkat keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:5
msgid "Deploy images to the terminals"
msgstr "Terapkan image ke terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:6
msgid "Each procedure is detailed in this section."
msgstr "Setiap prosedur dijelaskan secara terperinci dalam bagian ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For other methods of booting terminals, including using a USB device, or "
"booting over a wireless network, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk metode boot terminal lainnya, termasuk menggunakan perangkat USB atau melakukan boot melalui jaringan nirkabel, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals-other.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:8
msgid "Terminals can be either {x86_64} or {arm64} architecture."
msgstr "Terminal dapat menggunakan arsitektur {x86_64} atau {arm64}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you have many terminals, you can handle them with a script.  For more "
"information, see xref:retail:retail-mass-config.adoc[]."
msgstr "Jika Anda memiliki banyak terminal, Anda dapat mengelolanya dengan skrip.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:retail-mass-config.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before terminals can be deployed, ensure you have prepared a "
"{saltboot}-based operating system image.  For more information about "
"building OS images, see xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Sebelum terminal dapat diterapkan, pastikan Anda telah menyiapkan image sistem operasi berbasis {saltboot}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pembangunan image OS, lihat xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:11
msgid ""
"After you have registered new terminals, always check the {productname} "
"{webui} to ensure your terminals have connected successfully to the branch "
"server.  The terminals must not have directly connected to the {productname} "
"Server by mistake."
msgstr "Setelah mendaftarkan terminal baru, selalu periksa {webui} {productname} untuk memastikan terminal berhasil terhubung ke server cabang.  Terminal tidak boleh secara keliru terhubung langsung ke Server {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create A Hardware Type Group"
msgstr "Membuat Grup Jenis Perangkat Keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Each terminal requires a specific hardware type, which contains information "
"about the product name and terminal manufacturer.  However, at the "
"beginning, the {productname} database does not have this information.  To "
"tell {productname} what image to deploy on each terminal, you can set "
"hardware type groups.  After you have created a new hardware type group, you "
"can apply the {saltboot} formula to the group and configure it for your "
"environment."
msgstr "Setiap terminal memerlukan jenis perangkat keras tertentu yang berisi informasi tentang nama produk dan produsen terminal.  Namun, pada awalnya, basis data {productname} belum memiliki informasi ini.  Untuk memberi tahu {productname} image yang harus diterapkan pada setiap terminal, Anda dapat menetapkan grup jenis perangkat keras.  Setelah membuat grup jenis perangkat keras baru, Anda dapat menerapkan formula {saltboot} pada grup tersebut dan mengonfigurasinya sesuai lingkungan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Hardware types allow you to group devices according to manufacturer and "
"device name.  Then, all devices of a particular type can be managed as one."
msgstr "Jenis perangkat keras memungkinkan Anda mengelompokkan perangkat berdasarkan produsen dan nama perangkat.  Dengan demikian, semua perangkat dari jenis tertentu dapat dikelola sebagai satu kesatuan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Empty profiles can be assigned to a hardware type group either before or "
"after registration.  If an empty profile is not assigned to a hardware type "
"group before registration, it will be assigned to group that best matches "
"the product information available to it."
msgstr "Profil kosong dapat ditetapkan ke grup jenis perangkat keras sebelum atau setelah pendaftaran.  Jika profil kosong tidak ditetapkan ke grup jenis perangkat keras sebelum pendaftaran, profil tersebut akan ditetapkan ke grup yang paling sesuai dengan informasi produk yang tersedia untuknya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For this procedure, you will require the system manufacturer name and "
"product name for your terminal."
msgstr "Untuk prosedur ini, Anda memerlukan nama produsen sistem dan nama produk terminal Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Hardware Type Group"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Grup Jenis Perangkat Keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Determine the hardware type group name.  Prefix the name with `HWTYPE:`, "
"followed by the system manufacturer name and product name, separated by a "
"hyphen.  For example:"
msgstr "Tentukan nama grup jenis perangkat keras.  Awali nama dengan `HWTYPE:`, diikuti nama produsen sistem dan nama produk yang dipisahkan dengan tanda hubung.  Sebagai contoh:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "HWTYPE:POSVendor-Terminal1\n"
msgstr "HWTYPE:POSVendor-Terminal1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], and "
"click the btn:[Create Group] button."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[System Groups], lalu klik tombol btn:[Create Group]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the `Create System Group` dialog, create a new system group, using the "
"hardware type group name you determined in step one of this procedure."
msgstr "Dalam dialog `Create System Group`, buat grup sistem baru menggunakan nama grup jenis perangkat keras yang telah Anda tentukan pada langkah pertama prosedur ini."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Only use colons, hyphens, or underscores in hardware type group names.  "
"Spaces and other non-alphanumeric characters will be removed when the name "
"is processed."
msgstr "Gunakan hanya tanda titik dua, tanda hubung, atau garis bawah dalam nama grup jenis perangkat keras.  Spasi dan karakter nonalfanumerik lainnya akan dihapus saat nama diproses."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign and Configure the {saltboot} Formula for Each Hardware Type Group"
msgstr "Menetapkan dan Mengonfigurasi Formula {saltboot} untuk Setiap Grup Jenis Perangkat Keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:24
msgid "Each hardware type group must have the {saltboot} formula applied."
msgstr "Formula {saltboot} harus diterapkan pada setiap grup jenis perangkat keras."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning the {saltboot} Formula"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan Formula {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Open the details page for your new hardware type group, and navigate to the "
"`Formulas` tab."
msgstr "Buka halaman rincian grup jenis perangkat keras baru Anda, lalu buka tab `Formulas`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:27
msgid "Select the {saltboot} formula and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Pilih formula {saltboot}, lalu klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:28
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Saltboot] tab."
msgstr "Buka tab menu:Formulas[Saltboot]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Configure the {saltboot} formula.  For more information about the {saltboot} "
"formula, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan formula {saltboot}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula {saltboot}, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:30
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize Images to the Branch Server"
msgstr "Menyinkronkan Image ke Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Manual synchronization of images is no longer needed with "
"{susemgrbranch}. It is however possible to warm up the cache if required."
msgstr "Sinkronisasi image secara manual tidak lagi diperlukan dengan {susemgrbranch}. Namun, cache dapat diisi terlebih dahulu jika diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Squid cache on the {susemgrbranch} stores OS images with extremely long "
"freshness and are not usually purged from the cache."
msgstr "Cache Squid pada {susemgrbranch} menyimpan image OS dengan masa kesegaran yang sangat panjang, dan image tersebut biasanya tidak dihapus dari cache."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -o /dev/null -L https://$branchproxy/tftp/$url?org=$orgid\n"
msgstr "curl -o /dev/null -L https://$branchproxy/tftp/$url?org=$orgid\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:34
msgid "Where"
msgstr "Dengan keterangan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:35
msgid "`$branchproxy` is a branch server fully-qualified domain name"
msgstr "`$branchproxy` adalah nama domain lengkap server cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:36
msgid "`$url` is the path to the image file shown in the WebUI image details page"
msgstr "`$url` adalah jalur ke berkas image yang ditampilkan pada halaman rincian image di WebUI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:37
msgid ""
"`$orgid` is the numerical identified of the organization owning this branch "
"server instance"
msgstr "`$orgid` adalah pengenal numerik organisasi yang memiliki instans server cabang ini"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy Images to the Terminals"
msgstr "Menerapkan Image ke Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:39
msgid ""
"When you have your bootstrap image ready, you can deploy the image to the "
"terminals."
msgstr "Setelah image bootstrap siap, Anda dapat menerapkan image tersebut ke terminal."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying Images to the Terminals"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menerapkan Image ke Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:41
msgid "Power on your POS terminals."
msgstr "Nyalakan terminal POS Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:42
msgid ""
"The branch server will bootstrap the terminals according to the data you "
"have provided."
msgstr "Server cabang akan melakukan bootstrap terminal sesuai data yang telah Anda berikan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Customize the Terminal Image Download Process"
msgstr "Menyesuaikan Proses Pengunduhan Image Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:44
msgid ""
"You can change the terminal boot process using Salt pillars.  Two Salt "
"pillars allow you to change the protocol and server used to download the "
"image."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengubah proses boot terminal menggunakan Salt pillar.  Dua Salt pillar memungkinkan Anda mengubah protokol dan server yang digunakan untuk mengunduh image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The `saltboot_download_protocol` pillar specifies which protocol should be "
"used to download the image to the terminal.  This overrides the default "
"protocol specified in the image pillar.  Allowed values are `http`, `https`, "
"`ftp`, or `tftp`."
msgstr "Pillar `saltboot_download_protocol` menentukan protokol yang digunakan untuk mengunduh image ke terminal.  Pengaturan ini menggantikan protokol default yang ditentukan dalam pillar image.  Nilai yang diizinkan adalah `http`, `https`, `ftp`, atau `tftp`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:46
msgid ""
"The `saltboot_download_server` pillar specifies which server to use to "
"download the image.  This overrides the default hostname specified in the "
"image pillar."
msgstr "Pillar `saltboot_download_server` menentukan server yang digunakan untuk mengunduh image.  Pengaturan ini menggantikan nama host default yang ditentukan dalam pillar image."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:47
msgid ""
"In this example, the download server must be prepared by the `image_sync` "
"state before you begin."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, server unduhan harus disiapkan oleh state `image_sync` sebelum Anda memulai."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Changing the {saltboot} Image Download Protocol"
msgstr "Contoh: Mengubah Protokol Pengunduhan Image {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:49
msgid "This example changes the protocol used for all terminals."
msgstr "Contoh ini mengubah protokol yang digunakan untuk semua terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:50
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:58
msgid "Create the `top.sls` file with content:"
msgstr "Buat berkas `top.sls` dengan isi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base:\n"
"  '*':\n"
"    - saltboot_proto\n"
msgstr ""
"base:\n"
"  '*':\n"
"    - saltboot_proto\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:52
msgid "Create the `saltboot_proto.sls` file with content:"
msgstr "Buat berkas `saltboot_proto.sls` dengan isi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saltboot_download_protocol: http\n"
"# can be http, https, ftp, tftp\n"
msgstr ""
"saltboot_download_protocol: http\n"
"# dapat berupa http, https, ftp, tftp\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:54
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:62
msgid "Move these files to the container:"
msgstr "Pindahkan berkas-berkas ini ke kontainer:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl cp top.sls server:/srv/pillar/\n"
"mgrctl cp saltboot_proto.sls server:/srv/pillar/\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl cp top.sls server:/srv/pillar/\n"
"mgrctl cp saltboot_proto.sls server:/srv/pillar/\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Changing the {saltboot} Image Download Location"
msgstr "Contoh: Mengubah Lokasi Pengunduhan Image {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:57
msgid ""
"This example changes the download location for all terminals on a specified "
"branch server."
msgstr "Contoh ini mengubah lokasi pengunduhan untuk semua terminal pada server cabang tertentu."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base:\n"
"  'minion_id_prefix:$branch_prefix':\n"
"     - match: grain\n"
"     - $branch_prefix\n"
msgstr ""
"base:\n"
"  'minion_id_prefix:$branch_prefix':\n"
"     - match: grain\n"
"     - $branch_prefix\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:60
msgid "Create the `$branch_prefix.sls` file with content:"
msgstr "Buat berkas `$branch_prefix.sls` dengan isi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "saltboot_download_server: $download_server_fqdn\n"
msgstr "saltboot_download_server: $download_server_fqdn\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-deploy-terminals.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl cp top.sls server:/srv/pillar/\n"
"mgrctl cp $branch_prefix.sls server:/srv/pillar/\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl cp top.sls server:/srv/pillar/\n"
"mgrctl cp $branch_prefix.sls server:/srv/pillar/\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Retail Formulas"
msgstr "Pengantar Formula Ritel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Formulas are pre-written {salt} states, that are used to configure your "
"{productname} {smr} installation."
msgstr "Formula adalah state {salt} yang telah ditulis sebelumnya dan digunakan untuk mengonfigurasi instalasi {productname} {smr} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to apply common {productname} "
"formulas.  For the most commonly used formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan {webui} {productname} untuk menerapkan formula {productname} yang umum digunakan.  Untuk formula yang paling sering digunakan, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:4
msgid ""
"All formulas must be accurately configured for your {productname} {smr} "
"installation to function correctly."
msgstr "Semua formula harus dikonfigurasi secara akurat agar instalasi {productname} {smr} Anda berfungsi dengan benar."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch server formulas"
msgstr "Formula server cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Branch servers are configured using formulas. Formulas can be configured "
"using {productname} {webui}, or the {productname} API."
msgstr "Server cabang dikonfigurasi menggunakan formula. Formula dapat dikonfigurasi menggunakan {webui} {productname} atau API {productname}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Containerized branch server ({productname} {productnumber})"
msgstr "Server cabang berbasis kontainer ({productname} {productnumber})"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On a {productname} {productnumber} Proxy, PXE, TFTP and image "
"synchronization are provided as containerized services, which do not use "
"formulas."
msgstr "Pada Proxy {productname} {productnumber}, PXE, TFTP, dan sinkronisasi image disediakan sebagai layanan berbasis kontainer yang tidak menggunakan formula."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can use other formulas on the salt-managed Proxy container host if you "
"need them:"
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan formula lain pada host kontainer Proxy yang dikelola Salt jika diperlukan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Branch network formula, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc[]"
msgstr "Formula jaringan cabang, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:11
msgid "BIND formula, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc[]"
msgstr "Formula BIND, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:12
msgid "DHCPD formula, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[]"
msgstr "Formula DHCPD, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:13
msgid "The BIND and DHCPD formulas use container images."
msgstr "Formula BIND dan DHCPD menggunakan image kontainer."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For air-gapped environments, the container images for BIND and DHCPD "
"formulas must be manually pulled from a connected system, saved to a TAR "
"archive, transferred to the air-gapped server, and then loaded.  Refer to "
"the main air-gapped deployment documentation for detailed steps on this "
"process, ensuring you use the correct image paths and tags for the BIND and "
"DHCPD formulas."
msgstr "Untuk lingkungan air-gapped, image kontainer untuk formula BIND dan DHCPD harus ditarik secara manual dari sistem yang terhubung, disimpan ke arsip TAR, dipindahkan ke server air-gapped, lalu dimuat.  Lihat dokumentasi utama penerapan air-gapped untuk langkah-langkah terperinci proses ini, dan pastikan Anda menggunakan jalur serta tag image yang benar untuk formula BIND dan DHCPD."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Badly configured formulas can result in the branch server failing to work as "
"expected.  Due to the generic nature of formulas it is difficult to do "
"overall validation.  We recommend that you configure the branch server using "
"the {productname} {smr} command line utilities, and use individual formula "
"settings for further tuning if required.  For more information, see "
"xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "Formula yang dikonfigurasi dengan buruk dapat menyebabkan server cabang tidak berfungsi sesuai harapan.  Karena formula bersifat umum, validasi menyeluruh sulit dilakukan.  Sebaiknya konfigurasikan server cabang menggunakan utilitas baris perintah {productname} {smr}, lalu gunakan pengaturan masing-masing formula untuk penyesuaian lebih lanjut jika diperlukan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If a formula uses the same name as an existing Salt state, the two names "
"will collide.  This could result in the formula being used instead of the "
"state.  Always check the names of states and formulas to avoid name "
"collisions."
msgstr "Jika formula menggunakan nama yang sama dengan state Salt yang sudah ada, kedua nama tersebut akan berbenturan.  Hal ini dapat menyebabkan formula digunakan sebagai pengganti state.  Selalu periksa nama state dan formula untuk menghindari benturan nama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:17
msgid ""
"When you have made changes to your formula, ensure you apply the highstate.  "
"The highstate propagates your changes to the appropriate services."
msgstr "Setelah mengubah formula, pastikan Anda menerapkan highstate.  Highstate meneruskan perubahan Anda ke layanan yang sesuai."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partitioning and image deployment formula"
msgstr "Formula pengaturan partisi dan penerapan image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-formulas-intro.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Use the {saltboot} formula to specify disk partitioning, and to select which "
"image should be deployed.  For more information about the {saltboot} "
"formula, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "Gunakan formula {saltboot} untuk menentukan pengaturan partisi disk dan memilih image yang akan diterapkan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula {saltboot}, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Pillars"
msgstr "Pillar Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:2
msgid "If the built image type is `PXE`, a {salt} pillar is also generated."
msgstr "Jika jenis image yang dibangun adalah `PXE`, pillar {salt} juga dihasilkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Image pillars are stored in the database and {salt} subsystem can access "
"details about the generated image.  Details include where the image files "
"are located and provided, image checksums, information needed for network "
"boot, and more."
msgstr "Pillar image disimpan dalam basis data, dan subsistem {salt} dapat mengakses rincian image yang dihasilkan.  Rincian tersebut mencakup lokasi penyimpanan dan penyediaan berkas image, checksum image, informasi yang diperlukan untuk boot jaringan, dan lainnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:4
msgid "The generated pillar is available to all connected clients."
msgstr "Pillar yang dihasilkan tersedia bagi semua klien yang terhubung."

