#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Under the `Images` section, there is a specific image called "
"`POS_Image_JeOS7` with a version `7.1.0-1.` It provides various details such "
"as the image URL for download, architecture, hash, size, synchronization "
"information, image type (in this case, `PXE`), file system type, file name, "
"and an inactive flag to exclude it from auto-selection.  Additionally, it "
"references the corresponding boot image named `POS_Image_JeOS7-7.1.0-1.`"
msgstr "Pada bagian `Images`, terdapat image tertentu bernama `POS_Image_JeOS7` dengan versi `7.1.0-1.` Bagian ini menyediakan berbagai rincian, seperti URL pengunduhan image, arsitektur, hash, ukuran, informasi sinkronisasi, jenis image (dalam hal ini, `PXE`), jenis sistem berkas, nama berkas, dan flag inactive untuk mengecualikannya dari pemilihan otomatis.  Selain itu, bagian ini merujuk ke image boot terkait yang bernama `POS_Image_JeOS7-7.1.0-1.`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The `boot_images` section contains information about the boot image "
"`POS_Image_JeOS7-7.1.0-1.` It specifies the details about kernel and "
"`initrd`."
msgstr "Bagian `boot_images` berisi informasi tentang image boot `POS_Image_JeOS7-7.1.0-1.` Bagian ini menentukan rincian kernel dan `initrd`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Image pillar can be modified via API.  This example retrieves the image "
"pillar for a given image ID, and changes the `Inactive` flag to `True` and "
"writes it back."
msgstr "Pillar image dapat diubah melalui API.  Contoh ini mengambil pillar image untuk ID image tertentu, mengubah flag `Inactive` menjadi `True`, lalu menyimpannya kembali."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n"
"from xmlrpc.client import ServerProxy\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n"
"from xmlrpc.client import ServerProxy\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "MANAGER_URL = \"http://manager.example.com/rpc/api\"\n"
msgstr "MANAGER_URL = \"http://manager.example.com/rpc/api\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MANAGER_LOGIN = \"admin\"\n"
"MANAGER_PASSWORD = \"adminpass\"\n"
msgstr ""
"MANAGER_LOGIN = \"admin\"\n"
"MANAGER_PASSWORD = \"adminpass\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "IMAGE_ID=15\n"
msgstr "IMAGE_ID=15\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client = ServerProxy(MANAGER_URL)\n"
"key = client.auth.login(MANAGER_LOGIN, MANAGER_PASSWORD)\n"
msgstr ""
"client = ServerProxy(MANAGER_URL)\n"
"key = client.auth.login(MANAGER_LOGIN, MANAGER_PASSWORD)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pillar = client.image.getPillar(key, IMAGE_ID)\n"
"[(name, version_dict)] = pillar['images'].items()\n"
"[(version, image_data)] = version_dict.items()\n"
"image_data['inactive'] = True\n"
"client.image.setPillar(key, IMAGE_ID, pillar)\n"
msgstr ""
"pillar = client.image.getPillar(key, IMAGE_ID)\n"
"[(name, version_dict)] = pillar['images'].items()\n"
"[(version, image_data)] = version_dict.items()\n"
"image_data['inactive'] = True\n"
"client.image.setPillar(key, IMAGE_ID, pillar)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "client.auth.logout(key)\n"
msgstr "client.auth.logout(key)\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Up the {productname} {smr} Environment"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Lingkungan {productname} {smr}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:3
msgid "{productname} Server"
msgstr "Server {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:4
msgid "one or more {productname} {smr} branch server containerized proxy"
msgstr "satu atau beberapa proxy berbasis kontainer untuk server cabang {productname} {smr}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:5
msgid "one or more {productname} build hosts"
msgstr "satu atau beberapa host build {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:6
msgid ""
"network stack depending on selected network architecture, see "
"xref:retail:retail-network-arch.adoc[]"
msgstr "stack jaringan yang bergantung pada arsitektur jaringan yang dipilih, lihat xref:retail:retail-network-arch.adoc[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This section covers how to configure your {productname} {smr} environment, "
"including:"
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas cara mengonfigurasi lingkungan {productname} {smr} Anda, termasuk:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:8
msgid "Prepare POS images"
msgstr "Menyiapkan image POS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:9
msgid "Prepare system groups for {saltboot}"
msgstr "Menyiapkan grup sistem untuk {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:10
msgid "Configure services for {saltboot}"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi layanan untuk {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The very first time you set up the {productname} {smr} environment, you will "
"need to perform all configuration steps in order.  You will need to revisit "
"some of these steps later on as you are working with {productname} {smr}."
msgstr "Saat pertama kali menyiapkan lingkungan {productname} {smr}, Anda perlu menjalankan semua langkah konfigurasi secara berurutan.  Anda perlu mengulangi beberapa langkah ini di kemudian hari saat menggunakan {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For example, the first time you configure the branch server group, you will "
"need to have images prepared already.  If you are configuring more than one "
"branch server, the same images are reused across different branch server "
"groups."
msgstr "Misalnya, saat pertama kali mengonfigurasi grup server cabang, Anda harus sudah menyiapkan image.  Jika Anda mengonfigurasi lebih dari satu server cabang, image yang sama digunakan kembali di berbagai grup server cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If you have an existing environment, and need to build new images, you do "
"not need to re-initialize the branches."
msgstr "Jika Anda sudah memiliki lingkungan yang berjalan dan perlu membangun image baru, Anda tidak perlu menginisialisasi ulang cabang."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare and Build Terminal Images"
msgstr "Menyiapkan dan Membangun Image Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For information about {productname} image building, see "
"xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang pembangunan image {productname}, lihat xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} POS images are images specifically tailored for "
"{productname} {smr} environment and designed to be deployed using PXE "
"booting mechanism."
msgstr "Image POS {productname} {smr} adalah image yang secara khusus disesuaikan untuk lingkungan {productname} {smr} dan dirancang untuk diterapkan menggunakan mekanisme boot PXE."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "POS Image Templates"
msgstr "Templat Image POS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"As starting point, {suse} provides basic templates at "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage[].  These "
"templates need to be adapted for specific usecases, for example by including "
"specific applications, configuration settings, and users."
msgstr "Sebagai titik awal, {suse} menyediakan templat dasar di https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage[].  Templat ini perlu disesuaikan untuk kasus penggunaan tertentu, misalnya dengan menyertakan aplikasi, pengaturan konfigurasi, dan pengguna tertentu."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"POS image templates and resulting images do not set a system user password.  "
"You will not be able to login as a system user to a system that has been "
"installed with a {suse} provided template without customization.  However "
"you can use Salt to manage clients without a system user password.  You can "
"use {salt} to set up a system user password after the terminal has been "
"deployed."
msgstr "Templat image POS dan image yang dihasilkan tidak menetapkan kata sandi pengguna sistem.  Anda tidak akan dapat masuk sebagai pengguna sistem ke sistem yang diinstal menggunakan templat dari {suse} tanpa penyesuaian.  Namun, Anda dapat menggunakan Salt untuk mengelola klien tanpa kata sandi pengguna sistem.  Anda dapat menggunakan {salt} untuk menetapkan kata sandi pengguna sistem setelah terminal diterapkan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Validate POS Image Registration"
msgstr "Memvalidasi Pendaftaran Image POS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:21
msgid ""
"After POS image is successfully built and inspected by {productname}, you "
"can validate that POS boot image was correctly registered by following "
"procedure."
msgstr "Setelah image POS berhasil dibangun dan diperiksa oleh {productname}, Anda dapat memvalidasi bahwa image boot POS telah terdaftar dengan benar melalui prosedur berikut."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure Validate POS boot image"
msgstr "Prosedur Memvalidasi image boot POS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:23
msgid "On {productname} command line execute following command:"
msgstr "Pada baris perintah {productname}, jalankan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec cobbler distro list\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec cobbler distro list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:25
msgid "Your POS image should be listed with an organization name appended after it."
msgstr "Image POS Anda seharusnya tercantum dengan nama organisasi yang ditambahkan setelahnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch Identification"
msgstr "Identifikasi Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:27
msgid "For every branch server choose its `branch id`."
msgstr "Pilih `branch id` untuk setiap server cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:28
msgid "As a `branch id` select any alphanumerical string with up to 64 characters."
msgstr "Untuk `branch id`, pilih string alfanumerik apa pun dengan panjang maksimal 64 karakter."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required System Groups"
msgstr "Grup Sistem yang Diperlukan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:30
msgid "{productname} {smr} requires:"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} memerlukan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:31
msgid ""
"branch system group for every branch server proxy, using `branch id` as its "
"name"
msgstr "grup sistem cabang untuk setiap proxy server cabang, dengan `branch id` sebagai namanya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:32
msgid ""
"hardware type system group for every used hardware type, using `HWTYPE:` "
"prefix in its name"
msgstr "grup sistem jenis perangkat keras untuk setiap jenis perangkat keras yang digunakan, dengan awalan `HWTYPE:` pada namanya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For more information about hardware type groups, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang grup jenis perangkat keras, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:34
msgid "Missing mandatory system group will cause terminal bootstrap to fail."
msgstr "Tidak adanya grup sistem wajib akan menyebabkan bootstrap terminal gagal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:35
msgid "{productname} {smr} also recognizes two optional groups for better overview:"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} juga mengenali dua grup opsional untuk memberikan gambaran yang lebih jelas:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:37
msgid "`SERVERS`"
msgstr "`SERVERS`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"You can create system groups using the {productname} {webui}.  Navigate to "
"menu:Systems[System Groups] and click btn:[Create System Group]."
msgstr "Anda dapat membuat grup sistem menggunakan {webui} {productname}.  Buka menu:Systems[System Groups], lalu klik btn:[Create System Group]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:39
msgid ""
"For more information about system groups, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang grup sistem, lihat xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:40
msgid "During terminal bootstrap, terminal automatically joins:"
msgstr "Selama bootstrap, terminal secara otomatis bergabung dengan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:41
msgid ""
"branch system group based on received `branch_id`. This will make branch "
"group formulas available to the terminal."
msgstr "grup sistem cabang berdasarkan `branch_id` yang diterima. Hal ini membuat formula grup cabang tersedia bagi terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:42
msgid ""
"HWType group based on SMBios information received from terminal. This will "
"make {saltboot} partitioning pillar available to the terminal."
msgstr "grup HWType berdasarkan informasi SMBios yang diterima dari terminal. Hal ini membuat pillar pengaturan partisi {saltboot} tersedia bagi terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:43
msgid "`TERMINALS` if this group exists."
msgstr "`TERMINALS` jika grup ini tersedia."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In case you plan to use the branch server container host as a monitoring "
"server with Prometheus, be aware that Prometheus demands additional hardware "
"resources.  For more information about installing Prometheus, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "Jika Anda berencana menggunakan host kontainer server cabang sebagai server pemantauan dengan Prometheus, perlu diperhatikan bahwa Prometheus memerlukan sumber daya perangkat keras tambahan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang instalasi Prometheus, lihat xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In case you plan to use the branch server container host with Ansible "
"software, be aware that Ansible demands additional hardware resources.  For "
"more information about installing Ansible, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-integration.adoc[]."
msgstr "Jika Anda berencana menggunakan host kontainer server cabang dengan perangkat lunak Ansible, perlu diperhatikan bahwa Ansible memerlukan sumber daya perangkat keras tambahan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang instalasi Ansible, lihat xref:administration:ansible-integration.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Before configuring {saltboot} group, make sure you already have at least one "
"POS image available."
msgstr "Sebelum mengonfigurasi grup {saltboot}, pastikan Anda sudah memiliki setidaknya satu image POS yang tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Containerized {productname} {smr} is configured using so called `Saltboot "
"Group`."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} berbasis kontainer dikonfigurasi menggunakan apa yang disebut `Saltboot Group`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:49
msgid ""
"{saltboot} groups are branch groups, system group with `branch id` as its "
"name created in previous step, with `Saltboot Group` formula enabled."
msgstr "Grup {saltboot} adalah grup cabang, yaitu grup sistem dengan `branch id` sebagai namanya yang dibuat pada langkah sebelumnya, dengan formula `Saltboot Group` diaktifkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:50
msgid ""
"`Saltboot Group` formula is a successor of `Branch Network formula`, `PXE "
"formula` and `TFTP formula` previously used in {productname} {smr} setups."
msgstr "Formula `Saltboot Group` merupakan penerus `Branch Network formula`, `PXE formula`, dan `TFTP formula` yang sebelumnya digunakan dalam penyiapan {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:51
msgid ""
"To connect `Saltboot Group` with containerized proxy fill `Image Download "
"Server` entry with Fully Qualified Domain Name (`FQDN`) of the containerized "
"proxy."
msgstr "Untuk menghubungkan `Saltboot Group` dengan proxy berbasis kontainer, isi entri `Image Download Server` dengan Fully Qualified Domain Name (`FQDN`) proxy berbasis kontainer tersebut."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Network Services for {saltboot}"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Layanan Jaringan untuk {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:53
msgid ""
"{saltboot} technology is used to deploy POS images to the terminals.  "
"{saltboot} consists of saltboot enabled initrd (build as part of POS images) "
"and saltboot {salt} states."
msgstr "Teknologi {saltboot} digunakan untuk menerapkan image POS ke terminal. {saltboot} terdiri atas initrd yang mendukung saltboot (dibangun sebagai bagian dari image POS) dan state {salt} saltboot."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:54
msgid ""
"This section covers general information about generic {saltboot} "
"requirements.  For configuration examples, see "
"xref:retail:example-configurations.adoc[]."
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas informasi umum tentang persyaratan dasar {saltboot}.  Untuk contoh konfigurasi, lihat xref:retail:example-configurations.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable PXE Network Boot in the Terminal Network"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan Boot Jaringan PXE di Jaringan Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:56
msgid ""
"{saltboot} is usually used in network boot environment.  For this to work "
"`DHCP` service for the network terminal is connected to must have `PXE` or "
"sometimes called `BOOTP` support enabled."
msgstr "{saltboot} biasanya digunakan dalam lingkungan boot jaringan.  Agar dapat berfungsi, layanan `DHCP` pada jaringan yang terhubung dengan terminal harus mengaktifkan dukungan `PXE`, yang terkadang disebut `BOOTP`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of ISC DHCP server configuration with PXE booting enabled"
msgstr "Contoh konfigurasi server ISC DHCP dengan boot PXE diaktifkan"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  if substring (option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 10) = \"HTTPClient\" {\n"
"    option vendor-class-identifier \"HTTPClient\";\n"
"    filename \"<FQDN of branch server proxy>/saltboot/shim.efi\";\n"
"  }\n"
"  else {\n"
"    if option arch = 00:07 {\n"
"       filename \"grub/shim.efi\";\n"
"       next-server <IP address of branch server proxy>;\n"
"    }\n"
"    else {\n"
"      filename \"grub/grub.0\";\n"
"      next-server <IP address of branch server proxy>;\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
msgstr ""
"  if substring (option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 10) = \"HTTPClient\" {\n"
"    option vendor-class-identifier \"HTTPClient\";\n"
"    filename \"<FQDN of branch server proxy>/saltboot/shim.efi\";\n"
"  }\n"
"  else {\n"
"    if option arch = 00:07 {\n"
"       filename \"grub/shim.efi\";\n"
"       next-server <IP address of branch server proxy>;\n"
"    }\n"
"    else {\n"
"      filename \"grub/grub.0\";\n"
"      next-server <IP address of branch server proxy>;\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Notice two important options, `next-server` which is set to the branch "
"server IP address and `filename` set to the `pxelinux.0` for BIOS based "
"system and `grub/shim.efi` for UEFI systems with SecureBoot support."
msgstr "Perhatikan dua opsi penting, yaitu `next-server` yang diatur ke alamat IP server cabang dan `filename` yang diatur ke `pxelinux.0` untuk sistem berbasis BIOS serta `grub/shim.efi` untuk sistem UEFI dengan dukungan SecureBoot."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:60
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} branch proxy uses different `filename` then previous "
"non-containerized branch server."
msgstr "Proxy cabang {productname} {smr} menggunakan `filename` yang berbeda dari server cabang sebelumnya yang tidak berbasis kontainer."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:61
msgid ""
"For containerized branch proxy set `filename` to the `pxelinux.0` for BIOS "
"based system and `grub/shim.efi` for UEFI systems with SecureBoot."
msgstr "Untuk proxy cabang berbasis kontainer, atur `filename` ke `pxelinux.0` untuk sistem berbasis BIOS dan `grub/shim.efi` untuk sistem UEFI dengan SecureBoot."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminal Partitioning and Image Selection"
msgstr "Pengaturan Partisi Terminal dan Pemilihan Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:63
msgid ""
"{saltboot} requires instructions how to partitioning terminal harddisk and "
"what image to deploy.  This is done individually for each hardware type of "
"terminals.  For more information about hardware types and partitioning, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."
msgstr "{saltboot} memerlukan instruksi tentang cara mengatur partisi hard disk terminal dan image yang akan diterapkan.  Hal ini dilakukan secara terpisah untuk setiap jenis perangkat keras terminal.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang jenis perangkat keras dan pengaturan partisi, lihat xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Above mentioned steps are mandatory minimum for successful {saltboot} "
"deployment.  For configuration examples, see "
"xref:retail:example-configurations.adoc[]."
msgstr "Langkah-langkah yang disebutkan di atas merupakan persyaratan minimum wajib agar penerapan {saltboot} berhasil.  Untuk contoh konfigurasi, lihat xref:retail:example-configurations.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:66
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} {productnumber} no longer need manual image "
"synchronization, all images are available to all clients automatically."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} {productnumber} tidak lagi memerlukan sinkronisasi image secara manual; semua image tersedia bagi semua klien secara otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:67
msgid ""
"This may not be always desired, for example to allow images gradual "
"deployments across all branches.  For a way how to limit image deployment, "
"see xref:retail:retail-best-practices.adoc[]."
msgstr "Hal ini mungkin tidak selalu diinginkan, misalnya jika Anda ingin menerapkan image secara bertahap di seluruh cabang.  Untuk mengetahui cara membatasi penerapan image, lihat xref:retail:retail-best-practices.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Uyuni Retail Server with openSUSE"
msgstr "Menginstal Uyuni Retail Server dengan openSUSE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} {smr} Server can be installed on openSUSE."
msgstr "Server {productname} {smr} dapat diinstal pada openSUSE."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For general requirements, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk persyaratan umum, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about the latest version and updates of openSUSE Leap, "
"see https://doc.opensuse.org/release-notes/."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang versi terbaru dan pembaruan openSUSE Leap, lihat https://doc.opensuse.org/release-notes/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Uyuni on openSUSE Leap"
msgstr "Menginstal Uyuni pada openSUSE Leap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid "You install Uyuni as an add-on to openSUSE Leap."
msgstr "Anda menginstal Uyuni sebagai add-on untuk openSUSE Leap."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Uyuni on openSUSE Leap"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Uyuni pada openSUSE Leap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid ""
"As the base system, install openSUSE Leap with all available service packs "
"and package updates applied."
msgstr "Sebagai sistem dasar, instal openSUSE Leap dengan semua service pack dan pembaruan paket yang tersedia telah diterapkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Configure a resolvable fully qualified domain name (FQDN) with "
"menu:yast[System > Network Settings > Hostname/DNS]."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan nama domain lengkap (FQDN) yang dapat diresolusikan melalui menu:yast[System > Network Settings > Hostname/DNS]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "Set variables to use to create repository:"
msgstr "Tetapkan variabel yang akan digunakan untuk membuat repositori:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"
msgstr ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Add the repository for installing the {productname} Server software as "
"`root`:"
msgstr "Tambahkan repositori untuk menginstal perangkat lunak Server {productname} sebagai `root`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-server-stable\n"
msgstr "zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-server-stable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Refresh metadata from the repositories as `root`, and confirm the import of "
"new GPG key into the keyring:"
msgstr "Segarkan metadata dari repositori sebagai `root`, lalu konfirmasikan impor kunci GPG baru ke keyring:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper ref\n"
msgstr "zypper ref\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid "Install the pattern for the {productname} Server as `root`:"
msgstr "Instal pola untuk Server {productname} sebagai `root`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in patterns-uyuni_server\n"
msgstr "zypper in patterns-uyuni_server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid "Install the pattern for the {productname} {smr} product as `root`:"
msgstr "Instal pola untuk produk {productname} {smr} sebagai `root`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in patterns-uyuni_retail\n"
msgstr "zypper in patterns-uyuni_retail\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "Reboot the {productname} {smr} Server."
msgstr "Mulai ulang Server {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Continue with the server setup as described in "
"xref:retail:retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "Lanjutkan penyiapan server seperti yang dijelaskan dalam xref:retail:retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retail Installation"
msgstr "Instalasi Ritel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} and {productname} {smr} Branch Server are already part "
"of {productname} {productnumber} Server and Proxy containers."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} dan Server Cabang {productname} {smr} sudah menjadi bagian dari kontainer Server dan Proxy {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} Retail Server and {productname} Retail Branch Server are "
"already part of {productname} Server and Proxy containers."
msgstr "{productname} Retail Server dan {productname} Retail Branch Server sudah menjadi bagian dari kontainer Server dan Proxy {productname}."

#.  REMARK: ATM, the second method is disabled; cf. the jeos installation that here will probably work as well
#.  REMARK: Shall we enable retail-install-packages.adoc again?  Or better use jeos?
#.  REMARK: For the moment, commenting the following misleading sentences:
#.  However, it is also possible to install {productname} {smr} manually from packages.
#.  Both methods are described in this manual.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example YAML File for Mass Configuration"
msgstr "Contoh Berkas YAML untuk Konfigurasi Massal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use the `retail_yaml` command to import configuration parameters "
"from a manually prepared YAML file.  This section contains a YAML example "
"file with comments."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan perintah `retail_yaml` untuk mengimpor parameter konfigurasi dari berkas YAML yang disiapkan secara manual.  Bagian ini berisi contoh berkas YAML dengan komentar."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: YAML Mass Terminal Configuration File"
msgstr "Contoh: Berkas YAML untuk Konfigurasi Terminal Massal"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"branches:\n"
"# there are 2 possible setups: with / without dedicated NIC\n"
"#\n"
"# with dedicated NIC\n"
"  branchserver1.branch1.cz:     # salt ID of branch server\n"
"    branch_prefix: branch1      # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    server_name: branchserver1  # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    server_domain: branch1.cz   # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    nic: eth1                   # nic used for connecting terminals, default "
"taken from hw info in MLM\n"
"    dedicated_nic: true         # set to true if the terminals are on "
"separate network\n"
"    salt_cname: branchserver1.branch1.cz      # hostname of salt master / "
"broker for terminals, mandatory\n"
"    configure_firewall: true    # modify firewall configuration\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.2.1      # default for dedicated NIC: 192.168.1.1\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0      # default for dedicated NIC: 255.255.255.0\n"
"    dyn_range:                  # default for dedicated NIC: 192.168.1.10 - "
"192.168.1.250\n"
"        - 192.168.2.10\n"
"        - 192.168.2.250\n"
"# without dedicated NIC\n"
"# the DHCP formula is not used, DHCP is typically provided by a router\n"
"# the network parameters can be autodetected if the machine is already "
"connected to SUSE Manager\n"
"  branchserver2.branch2.cz:     # salt ID of branch server\n"
"    branch_prefix: branch2      # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    server_name: branchserver2  # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    server_domain: branch2.cz   # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    salt_cname: branchserver2.branch1.cz      # FQDN of salt master / broker "
"for terminals, mandatory\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.2.1      # optional, default taken from MLM data if "
"the machine is registered\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0      # optional, default taken from MLM data if "
"the machine is registered\n"
"    exclude_formulas:           # optional, do not configure listed "
"formulas\n"
"      - dhcp                    # without dedicated NIC the dhcp service is "
"typically provided by a router\n"
"    hwAddress: 11:22:33:44:55:66 # optional, required to connect "
"pre-configured entry with particular machine\n"
"                                 # during onboarding\n"
"    terminals:                       # configuration of static terminal "
"entries\n"
"      hostname1:                     # hostname\n"
"        hwAddress: aa:aa:aa:bb:bb:bb # required as unique id of a terminal\n"
"        IP: 192.168.2.50             # required for static dhcp and dns "
"entry\n"
"        saltboot:                    # optional, alternative 1: configure "
"terminal-specific pillar data\n"
"          partitioning:              # partitioning pillar as described in "
"saltboot documentation\n"
"            disk1:\n"
"              device: /dev/sda\n"
"              disklabel: msdos\n"
"              partitions:\n"
"                p1:\n"
"                  flags: swap\n"
"                  format: swap\n"
"                  size_MiB: 2000.0\n"
"                p2:\n"
"                  image: POS_Image_JeOS6\n"
"                  mountpoint: /\n"
"              type: DISK\n"
"      hostname2:                     # hostname\n"
"        hwAddress: aa:aa:aa:bb:bb:cc # required as unique id of a terminal\n"
"        IP: 192.168.2.51             # required for static dhcp and dns "
"entry\n"
"        hwtype: IBMCORPORATION-4838910 # optional, alternative 2: assign the "
"terminal to hwtype group\n"
"        # if neither of hwtype nor saltboot is specified, a group is "
"assigned according to hwtype\n"
"        # reported by bios on the first boot\n"
"hwtypes:\n"
"  IBMCORPORATION-4838910:      # HWTYPE string (manufacturer-model) as "
"returned by bios\n"
"    description: 4838-910       # freetext description\n"
"    saltboot:\n"
"      partitioning:             # partitioning pillar as described in "
"saltboot documentation\n"
"        disk1:\n"
"          device: /dev/sda\n"
"          disklabel: msdos\n"
"          partitions:\n"
"            p1:\n"
"              flags: swap\n"
"              format: swap\n"
"              size_MiB: 1000.0\n"
"            p2:\n"
"              image: POS_Image_JeOS6\n"
"              mountpoint: /\n"
"          type: DISK\n"
"  TOSHIBA-6140100:\n"
"    description: HWTYPE:TOSHIBA-6140100\n"
"    saltboot:\n"
"      partitioning:\n"
"        disk1:\n"
"          device: /dev/sda\n"
"          disklabel: msdos\n"
"          partitions:\n"
"            p1:\n"
"              flags: swap\n"
"              format: swap\n"
"              size_MiB: 1000.0\n"
"            p2:\n"
"              image: POS_Image_JeOS6\n"
"              mountpoint: /\n"
"          type: DISK\n"
msgstr ""
