#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mass Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Massal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:2
msgid "Mass configuration is possible with branch servers and terminals."
msgstr "Konfigurasi massal dapat dilakukan pada server cabang dan terminal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Mass configuration tool was not yet adapted for containerized saltboot "
"workflow."
msgstr "Alat konfigurasi massal belum disesuaikan untuk alur kerja saltboot berbasis kontainer."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch Server Mass Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Massal Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Branch servers are configured individually using formulas.  If you are "
"working in an environment with many branch servers, it often helps to "
"configure branch servers automatically with a pre-defined configuration "
"file, rather than configuring each one individually."
msgstr "Server cabang dikonfigurasi satu per satu menggunakan formula.  Jika Anda bekerja di lingkungan dengan banyak server cabang, mengonfigurasi server cabang secara otomatis menggunakan berkas konfigurasi yang telah ditentukan sebelumnya sering kali lebih membantu daripada mengonfigurasi setiap server satu per satu."

#.  https://gitlab.suse.de/SLEPOS/MLM_Retail/tree/master/python-susemanager-retail
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Before working with the mass configuration tool, back up the existing branch "
"servers configuration."
msgstr "Sebelum menggunakan alat konfigurasi massal, cadangkan konfigurasi server cabang yang ada."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The mass configuration tool overwrites the existing configuration with data "
"specified in the provided YAML file."
msgstr "Alat konfigurasi massal menimpa konfigurasi yang ada dengan data yang ditentukan dalam berkas YAML yang disediakan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The mass configuration tool does not support all possible formula "
"configurations.  Always make sure on a small sample that the mass "
"configuration tool can configure systems as expected."
msgstr "Alat konfigurasi massal tidak mendukung semua kemungkinan konfigurasi formula.  Selalu lakukan pengujian pada sampel kecil untuk memastikan bahwa alat konfigurasi massal dapat mengonfigurasi sistem sesuai harapan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Multiple Branch Servers"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Beberapa Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Configuring multiple branch servers requires the `python-susemanager-retail` "
"package, which is provided with {productname} {smr}.  Install the "
"`python-susemanager-retail` package on the {productname} server."
msgstr "Konfigurasi beberapa server cabang memerlukan paket `python-susemanager-retail`, yang disediakan bersama {productname} {smr}.  Instal paket `python-susemanager-retail` pada server {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Multiple Branch Servers"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi Beberapa Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Create a YAML file describing the infrastructure you intend to install.  For "
"an example YAML file, see xref:retail:retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc[]."
msgstr "Buat berkas YAML yang menjelaskan infrastruktur yang akan Anda instal. Untuk contoh berkas YAML, lihat xref:retail:retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:13
msgid ""
"On a clean {productname} {smr} installation, import the YAML file you have "
"created:"
msgstr "Pada instalasi baru {productname} {smr}, impor berkas YAML yang telah Anda buat:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:14
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_yaml --from-yaml filename.yaml\n"
msgstr "retail_yaml --from-yaml filename.yaml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:15
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:30
msgid "See the `retail_yaml --help` output for additional options."
msgstr "Lihat keluaran `retail_yaml --help` untuk opsi tambahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, check that your systems are listed correctly.  "
"Also check that the formulas you require are available."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, pastikan sistem Anda tercantum dengan benar. Pastikan juga formula yang Anda perlukan tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Create activation keys for each of your branch servers, register them using "
"bootstrap, and configure them as proxy servers."
msgstr "Buat kunci aktivasi untuk setiap server cabang Anda, daftarkan server tersebut menggunakan bootstrap, lalu konfigurasikan sebagai server proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:18
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the `States` tab, click btn:[Apply Highstate] to deploy your "
"configuration changes for each branch server."
msgstr "Pada tab `States`, klik btn:[Apply Highstate] untuk menerapkan perubahan konfigurasi pada setiap server cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:19
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If you need to change your configuration, you can edit the YAML file at any "
"time, and use the `retail_yaml --from-yaml` command to upload the new "
"configuration."
msgstr "Jika Anda perlu mengubah konfigurasi, Anda dapat mengedit berkas YAML kapan saja dan menggunakan perintah `retail_yaml --from-yaml` untuk mengunggah konfigurasi baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Use empty profiles together with activation keys to onboard all the systems "
"of your infrastructure.  Use an activation key to assign the channels listed "
"in xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "Gunakan profil kosong bersama kunci aktivasi untuk melakukan onboarding semua sistem dalam infrastruktur Anda.  Gunakan kunci aktivasi untuk menetapkan kanal yang tercantum dalam xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminal Mass Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Massal Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If you are working in an environment with many terminals, it often helps to "
"configure terminals automatically with a pre-defined configuration file, "
"rather than configuring each one individually."
msgstr "Jika Anda bekerja di lingkungan dengan banyak terminal, mengonfigurasi terminal secara otomatis menggunakan berkas konfigurasi yang telah ditentukan sebelumnya sering kali lebih membantu daripada mengonfigurasi setiap terminal satu per satu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You will need to have your infrastructure planned out ahead of time, "
"including the IP addresses, hostnames, and domain names of branch servers "
"and terminals.  You will also require the hardware (MAC) addresses of each "
"terminal."
msgstr "Anda perlu merencanakan infrastruktur terlebih dahulu, termasuk alamat IP, nama host, dan nama domain server cabang serta terminal.  Anda juga memerlukan alamat perangkat keras (MAC) setiap terminal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The settings specified in the configuration file cannot always be "
"successfully applied.  In cases where there is a conflict, {productname} "
"will ignore the request in the file.  This is especially important when "
"designating hostnames.  You should always check that the details have been "
"applied as expected after using this configuration method."
msgstr "Pengaturan yang ditentukan dalam berkas konfigurasi tidak selalu dapat diterapkan dengan berhasil.  Jika terjadi konflik, {productname} akan mengabaikan permintaan dalam berkas tersebut.  Hal ini sangat penting saat menetapkan nama host.  Setelah menggunakan metode konfigurasi ini, Anda harus selalu memastikan bahwa rincian telah diterapkan sesuai harapan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Multiple Terminals"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Beberapa Terminal"

#.  FIXME: this procedure is unclear.  Cut-and-paste error?  Or must we
#.  actually configure branch servers here as well (again?).
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Multiple Terminals"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi Beberapa Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Create a YAML file describing the infrastructure you intend to install, "
"specifying the hardware address for each terminal.  For an example YAML "
"file, see xref:retail:retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc[]."
msgstr "Buat berkas YAML yang menjelaskan infrastruktur yang akan Anda instal, dengan menentukan alamat perangkat keras setiap terminal.  Untuk contoh berkas YAML, lihat xref:retail:retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:28
msgid ""
"On a clean {productname} installation, import the YAML file you have "
"created:"
msgstr "Pada instalasi baru {productname}, impor berkas YAML yang telah Anda buat:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, check that your systems are listed and "
"displaying correctly, and the formulas you require are available."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, pastikan sistem Anda tercantum dan ditampilkan dengan benar, serta formula yang Anda perlukan tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Create activation keys for each of your branch servers, connect them using "
"bootstrap, and configure them as proxy servers."
msgstr "Buat kunci aktivasi untuk setiap server cabang Anda, hubungkan server tersebut menggunakan bootstrap, lalu konfigurasikan sebagai server proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:34
msgid "Connect your terminals according to your infrastructure plan."
msgstr "Hubungkan terminal Anda sesuai rencana infrastruktur."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export Configuration to Mass Configuration File"
msgstr "Mengekspor Konfigurasi ke Berkas Konfigurasi Massal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:37
msgid ""
"If you already have a configuration that you would like to export to a YAML "
"file, use:"
msgstr "Jika Anda sudah memiliki konfigurasi yang ingin diekspor ke berkas YAML, gunakan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_yaml --to-yaml filename.yaml\n"
msgstr "retail_yaml --to-yaml filename.yaml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:39
msgid ""
"This can be a good way to create a basic mass configuration file.  However, "
"it is important to check the file before using it, because some mandatory "
"configuration entries may be missing."
msgstr "Cara ini dapat digunakan untuk membuat berkas konfigurasi massal dasar.  Namun, penting untuk memeriksa berkas tersebut sebelum menggunakannya karena beberapa entri konfigurasi wajib mungkin tidak tercantum."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config.adoc:40
msgid ""
"When you are designing your configuration and creating the YAML file, ensure "
"the branch server ID matches the fully qualified hostname, and the Salt ID.  "
"If these do not match, the bootstrap script could fail."
msgstr "Saat merancang konfigurasi dan membuat berkas YAML, pastikan ID server cabang sama dengan nama host lengkap dan ID Salt.  Jika ketiganya tidak sama, skrip bootstrap dapat gagal."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Architecture"
msgstr "Arsitektur Jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} {smr} uses a layered architecture:"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} menggunakan arsitektur berlapis:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:3
msgid "The first layer contains the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Lapisan pertama berisi Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The second layer contains one or more branch servers to provide local "
"network and boot services.  It also contains one or more build hosts."
msgstr "Lapisan kedua berisi satu atau beberapa server cabang untuk menyediakan layanan jaringan lokal dan boot.  Lapisan ini juga berisi satu atau beberapa host build."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:5
msgid "The final layer contains any number of deployed point-of-service terminals."
msgstr "Lapisan terakhir berisi sejumlah terminal point-of-service yang telah diterapkan."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_arch_mlm.png"
msgstr "retail_arch_mlm.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Branch servers should be physically located close to point-of-service "
"terminals, such as in an individual store or branch office.  We recommend "
"you have a fast network connection between the branch server and its "
"terminals.  Branch servers provide services for PXE boot, and act as an "
"image cache, Salt broker, and proxy for software components (RPM packages).  "
"The branch servers can also manage local networking, and provide DHCP and "
"DNS services."
msgstr "Server cabang sebaiknya ditempatkan secara fisik di dekat terminal point-of-service, misalnya di setiap toko atau kantor cabang.  Sebaiknya gunakan koneksi jaringan yang cepat antara server cabang dan terminalnya.  Server cabang menyediakan layanan boot PXE dan berfungsi sebagai cache image, broker Salt, serta proxy untuk komponen perangkat lunak (paket RPM).  Server cabang juga dapat mengelola jaringan lokal serta menyediakan layanan DHCP dan DNS."

#.  For technical background information on {productname} Proxies, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-unified.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:8
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} Branch Servers are implemented as enhanced {productname} "
"Proxies."
msgstr "Server Cabang {productname} {smr} diimplementasikan sebagai Proxy {productname} dengan kemampuan yang diperluas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} Branch Servers are implemented as enhanced {productname} "
"Proxies.  For technical background information on {productname} Proxies, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "Server Cabang {productname} {smr} diimplementasikan sebagai Proxy {productname} dengan kemampuan yang diperluas.  Untuk informasi latar belakang teknis tentang Proxy {productname}, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch Server Network Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Jaringan Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:11
msgid ""
"You can use branch servers in different network configurations, depending on "
"your installation requirements."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan server cabang dalam berbagai konfigurasi jaringan, sesuai persyaratan instalasi Anda."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shared Network Architecture"
msgstr "Arsitektur Jaringan Bersama"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The branch server and the terminals are connected to the same network as the "
"{productname} Server.  In this configuration, external routers provide DHCP "
"and DNS services to the branch servers and the terminals, and the branch "
"server provides PXE, HTTP and TFTP services to the terminals in their branch "
"network."
msgstr "Server cabang dan terminal terhubung ke jaringan yang sama dengan Server {productname}.  Dalam konfigurasi ini, router eksternal menyediakan layanan DHCP dan DNS bagi server cabang dan terminal, sedangkan server cabang menyediakan layanan PXE, HTTP, dan TFTP bagi terminal di jaringan cabangnya."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_shared_network_mlm.png"
msgstr "retail_shared_network_mlm.png"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Externally Managed Dedicated Network Architecture"
msgstr "Arsitektur Jaringan Khusus yang Dikelola Secara Eksternal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The branch servers are in separate branch networks, along with the terminals "
"they manage.  In this configuration, external routers provide DHCP and DNS "
"services to the branch servers and the terminals, and the branch server "
"provides proxy, PXE, HTTP and TFTP services to the terminals in their branch "
"network."
msgstr "Server cabang berada di jaringan cabang yang terpisah, bersama terminal yang dikelolanya.  Dalam konfigurasi ini, router eksternal menyediakan layanan DHCP dan DNS bagi server cabang dan terminal, sedangkan server cabang menyediakan layanan proxy, PXE, HTTP, dan TFTP bagi terminal di jaringan cabangnya."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_external_network_mlm.png"
msgstr "retail_external_network_mlm.png"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dedicated Network Architecture"
msgstr "Arsitektur Jaringan Khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The branch servers are in the same network as the {productname} Server, and "
"terminals use an isolated branch network.  In this configuration, the branch "
"servers are in the corporate network, and provide all DHCP, DNS, PXE, HTTP "
"and TFTP services to the terminals in the branch networks."
msgstr "Server cabang berada di jaringan yang sama dengan Server {productname}, sedangkan terminal menggunakan jaringan cabang yang terisolasi.  Dalam konfigurasi ini, server cabang berada di jaringan perusahaan dan menyediakan semua layanan DHCP, DNS, PXE, HTTP, dan TFTP bagi terminal di jaringan cabang."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-network-arch.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_dedicated_nic_mlm.png"
msgstr "retail_dedicated_nic_mlm.png"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-next.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "What Next?"
msgstr "Langkah Selanjutnya?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-next.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This document covers only a sub-section of information about your "
"{productname} {smr} installation.  If you need further information or "
"support, try one of these options."
msgstr "Dokumen ini hanya mencakup sebagian informasi tentang instalasi {productname} {smr} Anda.  Jika Anda memerlukan informasi atau dukungan lebih lanjut, gunakan salah satu opsi berikut."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-next.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "More Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentasi Lainnya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-next.adoc:4
msgid "For {productname} documentation, visit https://documentation.suse.com//4.3/."
msgstr "Untuk dokumentasi {productname}, kunjungi https://documentation.suse.com//4.3/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-next.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Legacy documentation is available upon request for information purposes "
"only.  Note, however, that {productname} {smr} documentation supersedes "
"legacy information."
msgstr "Dokumentasi lama tersedia atas permintaan hanya untuk tujuan informasi.  Namun, perlu diperhatikan bahwa dokumentasi {productname} {smr} menggantikan informasi lama."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-next.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Dukungan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-next.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For personalized support, log in to your {scclongform} account at "
"https://scc.suse.com/login."
msgstr "Untuk dukungan yang disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan Anda, masuk ke akun {scclongform} Anda di https://scc.suse.com/login."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-next.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For assistance with planning and installing your {productname} {smr} "
"environment, contact the SUSE Consulting team."
msgstr "Untuk bantuan dalam merencanakan dan menginstal lingkungan {productname} {smr} Anda, hubungi tim SUSE Consulting."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Offline Use"
msgstr "Penggunaan Offline"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If the {productname} Server is offline, you can still perform some "
"operations on the terminals.  This is useful if the connection between the "
"branch server and the {productname} Server is unstable or has low "
"bandwidth.  This feature uses caching to perform updates."
msgstr "Jika Server {productname} offline, Anda tetap dapat menjalankan beberapa operasi pada terminal.  Hal ini berguna jika koneksi antara server cabang dan Server {productname} tidak stabil atau memiliki bandwidth rendah.  Fitur ini menggunakan cache untuk melakukan pembaruan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Offline Terminal Reboot"
msgstr "Mulai Ulang Terminal Secara Offline"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If the {productname} Server is offline, and a terminal is rebooted, it will "
"fall back to a previously installed image."
msgstr "Jika Server {productname} offline dan terminal dimulai ulang, terminal akan kembali menggunakan image yang telah diinstal sebelumnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:5
msgid "This will occur in these situations:"
msgstr "Hal ini terjadi dalam situasi berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If the {saltboot} formula has not started within a specified time (default "
"value is 60 seconds)."
msgstr "Jika formula {saltboot} belum dimulai dalam waktu yang ditentukan (nilai default adalah 60 detik)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:7
msgid ""
"If the terminal does not acknowledge that the {saltboot} formula has "
"started."
msgstr "Jika terminal tidak mengonfirmasi bahwa formula {saltboot} telah dimulai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If the root partition is specified on the kernel command line (handled by "
"the PXE formula), is mountable (and is not encrypted), and contains "
"`/etc/ImageVersion` (which is created by Kiwi)."
msgstr "Jika partisi root ditentukan pada baris perintah kernel (ditangani oleh formula PXE), dapat dipasang (dan tidak terenkripsi), serta berisi `/etc/ImageVersion` (yang dibuat oleh Kiwi)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can adjust the timeout value by changing the `SALT_TIMEOUT` kernel "
"parameter.  The parameter is measured in seconds, and defaults to `60`."
msgstr "Anda dapat menyesuaikan nilai batas waktu dengan mengubah parameter kernel `SALT_TIMEOUT`.  Parameter ini diukur dalam detik dan memiliki nilai default `60`."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "SALT_TIMEOUT = 60\n"
msgstr "SALT_TIMEOUT = 60\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more about kernel parameters, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang parameter kernel, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cached Terminal Updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan Terminal Menggunakan Cache"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If the bandwidth between the branch server and the terminal is low, or for "
"optimization of the terminal update process, POS images can be cached in "
"advance on the terminal.  The upgrade can then performed on the terminals "
"when suitable."
msgstr "Jika bandwidth antara server cabang dan terminal rendah, atau untuk mengoptimalkan proses pembaruan terminal, image POS dapat disimpan terlebih dahulu dalam cache pada terminal.  Peningkatan versi kemudian dapat dilakukan pada terminal pada waktu yang sesuai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This functionality requires the terminal to have a dedicated service "
"partition. A service partition is a partition mounted as `/srv/saltboot`.  "
"This partition must be created before the system partition and large enough "
"to store a POS image.  To ensure that terminals will always have such a "
"partition, use the {saltboot} formula for terminal hardware type to specify "
"the partition details.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "Fungsi ini mengharuskan terminal memiliki partisi layanan khusus. Partisi layanan adalah partisi yang dipasang sebagai `/srv/saltboot`.  Partisi ini harus dibuat sebelum partisi sistem dan berukuran cukup besar untuk menyimpan image POS.  Untuk memastikan terminal selalu memiliki partisi tersebut, gunakan formula {saltboot} untuk jenis perangkat keras terminal guna menentukan rincian partisi.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When the service partition is set up on the terminal, a POS image can be "
"downloaded in advance by applying the `saltboot.cache_image` state:"
msgstr "Setelah partisi layanan disiapkan pada terminal, image POS dapat diunduh terlebih dahulu dengan menerapkan state `saltboot.cache_image`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt $TERMINALID state.apply saltboot.cache_image\n"
msgstr "salt $TERMINALID state.apply saltboot.cache_image\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:17
msgid ""
"This can be done regularly to ensure that terminals always have an uptodate "
"POS image downloaded."
msgstr "Hal ini dapat dilakukan secara berkala untuk memastikan terminal selalu memiliki image POS terbaru yang telah diunduh."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-offline.adoc:18
msgid ""
"When the terminal is rebooted and an uptodate POS image is found in the "
"service partition, the terminal will automatically use this cached image for "
"system redeployment."
msgstr "Saat terminal dimulai ulang dan image POS terbaru ditemukan dalam partisi layanan, terminal akan secara otomatis menggunakan image dalam cache tersebut untuk penerapan ulang sistem."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:1
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retail Guide"
msgstr "Panduan Ritel"

#.  PDF Publication
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:24
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Publication Date:** {docdate}\n"
msgstr "**Tanggal Publikasi:** {docdate}\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:3
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:16
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:3
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preface"
msgstr "Prakata"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:4
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:18
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:4
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:13
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} {productnumber} is an **open-source infrastructure "
"management solution**, specifically **optimized for the retail industry**.  "
"Built on the same technology as {productname}, it has been tailored to meet "
"the unique operational needs of retail organizations."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} {productnumber} adalah **solusi pengelolaan infrastruktur sumber terbuka** yang secara khusus **dioptimalkan untuk industri ritel**.  Dibangun dengan teknologi yang sama seperti {productname}, solusi ini telah disesuaikan untuk memenuhi kebutuhan operasional unik organisasi ritel."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:5
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:19
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:5
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Designed for **retail environments**, {productname} {smr} supports "
"**point-of-service (POS) terminals**, allowing businesses to manage "
"transactions, promotions, and customer loyalty programs.  Beyond retail, it "
"can also be used in **educational institutions** to maintain student "
"computers, as well as in **banks and hospitals** for self-service kiosks."
msgstr "Dirancang untuk **lingkungan ritel**, {productname} {smr} mendukung **terminal point-of-service (POS)**, sehingga bisnis dapat mengelola transaksi, promosi, dan program loyalitas pelanggan.  Selain di sektor ritel, solusi ini juga dapat digunakan di **institusi pendidikan** untuk memelihara komputer siswa, serta di **bank dan rumah sakit** untuk kios layanan mandiri."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:6
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:20
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:6
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:15
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} is suited for deployments that include **servers, "
"workstations, point-of-service terminals, and other connected devices**.  It "
"enables administrators to **install, configure, and update software across "
"their infrastructure**, while streamlining **deployment and provisioning** "
"of POS machines."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} cocok untuk penerapan yang mencakup **server, workstation, terminal point-of-service, dan perangkat terhubung lainnya**.  Solusi ini memungkinkan administrator **menginstal, mengonfigurasi, dan memperbarui perangkat lunak di seluruh infrastruktur**, sekaligus menyederhanakan **penerapan dan provisi** mesin POS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:7
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:21
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:7
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:16
msgid ""
"This guide provides a **comprehensive overview** of {productname} {smr}, "
"covering its **initial installation and setup**."
msgstr "Panduan ini memberikan **gambaran menyeluruh** tentang {productname} {smr}, yang mencakup **instalasi dan penyiapan awal**."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For complete documentation, refer to the **{productname} documentation "
"suite** at https://documentation.suse.com/."
msgstr "Untuk dokumentasi lengkap, lihat **kumpulan dokumentasi {productname}** di https://documentation.suse.com/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-overview.adoc:9
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more details on managing your {productname} {smr} environment or seeking "
"assistance, see xref:retail:retail-next.adoc[]"
msgstr "Untuk rincian lebih lanjut tentang pengelolaan lingkungan {productname} {smr} Anda atau untuk mendapatkan bantuan, lihat xref:retail:retail-next.adoc[]"

