#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retail Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Ritel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before you install {productname} {smr}, ensure your environment meets the "
"minimum requirements.  This section lists the requirements for the "
"{productname} {smr} installation."
msgstr "Sebelum menginstal {productname} {smr}, pastikan lingkungan Anda memenuhi persyaratan minimum.  Bagian ini mencantumkan persyaratan untuk instalasi {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Review also general requirements of the {productname} listed at "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "Tinjau juga persyaratan umum {productname} yang tercantum di xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "{productname} {smr} is only supported on the {x86_64} architecture."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} hanya didukung pada arsitektur {x86_64}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "{productname} {smr} is tested on {x86_64} architecture."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} diuji pada arsitektur {x86_64}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Server"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{productname} performance depends on hardware resources, network bandwidth, "
"latency between clients and server, etc."
msgstr "Kinerja {productname} bergantung pada sumber daya perangkat keras, bandwidth jaringan, latensi antara klien dan server, dan sebagainya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Based on the experience and different deployments that are in use, the "
"advice for optimal performance of {productname} Server with an adequate "
"number of proxies is to not exceed 10,000 clients per single server.  It is "
"highly recommended to move to the Hub setup and involve consultancy when you "
"have more than 10,000 clients.  Even with fine-tuning and an adequate number "
"of proxies, such a large number of clients can lead to performance issues."
msgstr "Berdasarkan pengalaman dan berbagai penerapan yang digunakan, untuk memperoleh kinerja optimal Server {productname} dengan jumlah proxy yang memadai, sebaiknya jumlah klien tidak melebihi 10.000 per server. Jika Anda memiliki lebih dari 10.000 klien, sangat disarankan untuk beralih ke penyiapan Hub dan melibatkan layanan konsultasi.  Meskipun telah dilakukan penyesuaian terperinci dan tersedia jumlah proxy yang memadai, jumlah klien sebesar itu tetap dapat menyebabkan masalah kinerja."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information about managing a large number of clients, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan klien dalam jumlah besar, lihat xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."

