#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build Host Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Host Build"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements for Build Host"
msgstr "Persyaratan Perangkat Keras untuk Host Build"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Hardware                 | Recommended\n"
"| CPU                      | Multi-core 64-bit CPU\n"
"| RAM:                     | _Test Server_ Minimum 2{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                          | _Production Server_ Minimum 4{nbsp}GB\n"
"| Disk Space:              | `/` _(root)_ Minimum 24{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                          | `/var/lib/Kiwi` Minimum 15{nbsp}GB\n"
msgstr ""
"| Perangkat Keras          | Direkomendasikan\n"
"| CPU                   | CPU 64-bit multiinti\n"
"| RAM:                     | _Server Pengujian_ Minimal 2{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                          | _Server Produksi_ Minimal 4{nbsp}GB\n"
"| Ruang Disk:              | `/` _(root)_ Minimal 24{nbsp}GB\n"
"|                          | `/var/lib/Kiwi` Minimal 15{nbsp}GB\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:17
msgid "The {productname} Server requires a reliable and fast WAN connection."
msgstr "Server {productname} memerlukan koneksi WAN yang andal dan cepat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The branch server requires a reliable WAN connection, to reach the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "Server cabang memerlukan koneksi WAN yang andal untuk menjangkau Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If you are using a dedicated network, the branch server requires at least "
"two network interfaces: one connected to the WAN with a reachable "
"{productname} Server, and one connected to the internal branch LAN."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan jaringan khusus, server cabang memerlukan setidaknya dua antarmuka jaringan: satu terhubung ke WAN yang dapat menjangkau Server {productname}, dan satu terhubung ke LAN internal cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:20
msgid "Terminals require a LAN connection to the branch server network."
msgstr "Terminal memerlukan koneksi LAN ke jaringan server cabang."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "POS Terminal Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Terminal POS"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements for Terminals"
msgstr "Persyaratan Perangkat Keras untuk Terminal"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Hardware                 | Recommended\n"
"| RAM:                     | Minimum 1 GB for hosts that need to run OS "
"images built with Kiwi (PXE booted or not)\n"
"| Disk Space:              | Disk space depends on size of the OS image\n"
msgstr ""
"| Perangkat Keras          | Direkomendasikan\n"
"| RAM:                  | Minimal 1 GB untuk host yang perlu menjalankan image OS yang dibangun dengan Kiwi (baik di-boot melalui PXE maupun tidak)\n"
"| Ruang Disk:              | Ruang disk bergantung pada ukuran image OS\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information, see the documentation of the underlying system (in "
"this case: {sles}{nbsp}15)."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat dokumentasi sistem yang mendasarinya (dalam hal ini: {sles}{nbsp}15)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For more information on {productname} {smr} POS terminals, see documentation "
"on {productname} Salt clients "
"(xref:client-configuration:client-config-overview.adoc[])."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang terminal POS {productname} {smr}, lihat dokumentasi klien Salt {productname} (xref:client-configuration:client-config-overview.adoc[])."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information on {productname} {smr} POS terminals, see documentation "
"on {productname} Salt clients "
"(xref:client-configuration:uyuni-client-config-overview.adoc[])."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang terminal POS {productname} {smr}, lihat dokumentasi klien Salt {productname} (xref:client-configuration:uyuni-client-config-overview.adoc[])."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "UEFI Secure Booting Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Boot Aman UEFI"

#.  UEFI Secure Boot should work on Leap.
#.  2020-08-27, ke: I think we do not need to mention this in the uyuni context
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Secure boot from the network using UEFI PXE or UEFI HTTP is supported on "
"both {sles}{nbsp}12 and {sles}{nbsp}15.  Booting from a hard disk using UEFI "
"Secure Boot is fully supported on {sles}{nbsp}15 images only."
msgstr "Boot aman melalui jaringan menggunakan UEFI PXE atau UEFI HTTP didukung pada {sles}{nbsp}12 dan {sles}{nbsp}15.  Boot dari hard disk menggunakan UEFI Secure Boot hanya didukung sepenuhnya pada image {sles}{nbsp}15."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:29
msgid ""
"You cannot boot {sles}{nbsp}12 images using UEFI secure boot from a hard "
"disk.  This is due to limitations with the legacy Kiwi service.  You need to "
"either disable UEFI secure boot, or upgrade your terminals to "
"{sles}{nbsp}15."
msgstr "Anda tidak dapat melakukan boot image {sles}{nbsp}12 menggunakan UEFI Secure Boot dari hard disk.  Hal ini disebabkan oleh keterbatasan layanan Kiwi lama.  Anda perlu menonaktifkan UEFI Secure Boot atau meningkatkan versi terminal ke {sles}{nbsp}15."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-diagram.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminal Boot Process ({saltboot} Diagram)"
msgstr "Proses Boot Terminal (Diagram {saltboot})"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-diagram.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {saltboot} process involves the {productname} Server, a terminal running "
"the {saltboot} `initrd`, and the branch server providing the {saltboot} "
"services to the terminal."
msgstr "Proses {saltboot} melibatkan Server {productname}, terminal yang menjalankan `initrd` {saltboot}, dan server cabang yang menyediakan layanan {saltboot} bagi terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-diagram.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This sequence diagram explains how the three components interact with each "
"other to boot a terminal."
msgstr "Diagram urutan ini menjelaskan cara ketiga komponen berinteraksi untuk melakukan boot terminal."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-diagram.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "saltboot-sequence.png"
msgstr "saltboot-sequence.png"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Forced {saltboot} image redeployment"
msgstr "Penerapan ulang image {saltboot} secara paksa"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Systems provisioned by {saltboot} are usually redeployed or repartitioned "
"automatically when a new image is available, or {saltboot} partitioning "
"changes."
msgstr "Sistem yang diprovisikan oleh {saltboot} biasanya diterapkan ulang atau dipartisi ulang secara otomatis ketika image baru tersedia atau pengaturan partisi {saltboot} berubah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Occasionally, however, it is needed to force {saltboot} to redeploy an image "
"or repartition disk, even when automation would not do so.  For these "
"situations, {saltboot} offers three ways to force redeployment or "
"repartitioning:"
msgstr "Namun, terkadang {saltboot} perlu dipaksa untuk menerapkan ulang image atau mempartisi ulang disk, meskipun proses otomatis tidak melakukannya.  Untuk situasi ini, {saltboot} menyediakan tiga cara untuk memaksa penerapan ulang atau pengaturan ulang partisi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:4
msgid "<<force.redeployment.using.grains>>"
msgstr "<<force.redeployment.using.grains>>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:5
msgid "<<force.redeployment.using.custom.info>>"
msgstr "<<force.redeployment.using.custom.info>>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:6
msgid "<<force.redeployment.using.api>>"
msgstr "<<force.redeployment.using.api>>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:7
msgid "<<force.redeployment.using.pillar>>"
msgstr "<<force.redeployment.using.pillar>>"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Repartitioning of a terminal removes all data stored on the terminal hard "
"disk, including any persistent partitions."
msgstr "Pengaturan ulang partisi terminal menghapus semua data yang tersimpan pada hard disk terminal, termasuk semua partisi persisten."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Force {saltboot} redeployment using {salt} grains"
msgstr "Memaksa penerapan ulang {saltboot} menggunakan grain {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:10
msgid ""
"{saltboot} redeployment grains have no side effects, and do not require any "
"further configuration.  The limitation is that terminal must be accessible "
"by `salt`."
msgstr "Grain penerapan ulang {saltboot} tidak memiliki efek samping dan tidak memerlukan konfigurasi tambahan.  Keterbatasannya adalah terminal harus dapat diakses melalui `salt`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Forcing {saltboot} to redeploy image"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memaksa {saltboot} menerapkan ulang image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, as root, apply this {salt} state at the command "
"prompt:"
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, sebagai root, terapkan state {salt} berikut pada prompt perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt $terminal_minion_id state.apply saltboot.force_redeploy\n"
msgstr "salt $terminal_minion_id state.apply saltboot.force_redeploy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:14
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:18
msgid "Restart the terminal to pick up the changes."
msgstr "Mulai ulang terminal agar perubahan diterapkan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Forcing a {saltboot} to repartition the hard disk"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memaksa {saltboot} mempartisi ulang hard disk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, as root, apply this Salt state at the command "
"prompt:"
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, sebagai root, terapkan state Salt berikut pada prompt perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt $terminal_minion_id state.apply saltboot.force_repartition\n"
msgstr "salt $terminal_minion_id state.apply saltboot.force_repartition\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Force {saltboot} redeployment using custom info values"
msgstr "Memaksa penerapan ulang {saltboot} menggunakan nilai informasi khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:20
msgid ""
"{saltboot} custom values remove the limitation on terminal being reachable "
"by `salt`, however there are configuration steps."
msgstr "Nilai khusus {saltboot} menghilangkan persyaratan bahwa terminal harus dapat dijangkau melalui `salt`, tetapi memerlukan beberapa langkah konfigurasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Custom info keys and values can be also managed using API or `spacecmd` "
"command.  For more information, see "
"xref:reference:spacecmd/custominfo.adoc[]."
msgstr "Kunci dan nilai informasi khusus juga dapat dikelola menggunakan API atau perintah `spacecmd`.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:reference:spacecmd/custominfo.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Create custom info key for image redeployment"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat kunci informasi khusus untuk penerapan ulang image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:23
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Custom System Info]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Custom System Info]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:24
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:40
msgid "Click `Create Key` to create new `Custom Info Key`."
msgstr "Klik `Create Key` untuk membuat `Custom Info Key` baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:25
msgid "As `Key Label` fill in `saltboot_force_redeploy`."
msgstr "Isi `Key Label` dengan `saltboot_force_redeploy`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:26
msgid "As `Description` fill in `Force redeploy {saltboot} image`."
msgstr "Isi `Description` dengan `Force redeploy {saltboot} image`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:27
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:43
msgid "Click `Create Key`."
msgstr "Klik `Create Key`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Creating `saltboot_force_redeploy` custom key is a one time operation.  When "
"created, it is available for repeated use."
msgstr "Pembuatan kunci khusus `saltboot_force_redeploy` hanya perlu dilakukan satu kali.  Setelah dibuat, kunci ini dapat digunakan berulang kali."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assign custom value for image redeployment"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan nilai khusus untuk penerapan ulang image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:30
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:46
msgid "Navigate to the `Overview` page of the system you want to redeploy."
msgstr "Buka halaman `Overview` sistem yang ingin Anda terapkan ulang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:31
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:47
msgid "Select tab `Custom Info`."
msgstr "Pilih tab `Custom Info`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:32
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:48
msgid "Click on `Create Value`."
msgstr "Klik `Create Value`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:33
msgid "From the list of available keys click `saltboot_force_redeploy`."
msgstr "Dari daftar kunci yang tersedia, klik `saltboot_force_redeploy`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:34
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:50
msgid "As `Value` type `True`."
msgstr "Pada `Value`, ketik `True`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:35
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:51
msgid "Click `Update Key`."
msgstr "Klik `Update Key`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:36
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:52
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:73
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:81
msgid "Reboot the terminal to pick up the changes."
msgstr "Mulai ulang terminal agar perubahan diterapkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:37
msgid ""
"After terminal finishes booting, {saltboot} redeployment custom info setting "
"is automatically reset to prevent repeated redeployment."
msgstr "Setelah terminal selesai melakukan boot, pengaturan informasi khusus untuk penerapan ulang {saltboot} direset secara otomatis guna mencegah penerapan ulang berulang."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Create custom info key for disk repartitioning"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat kunci informasi khusus untuk pengaturan ulang partisi disk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:39
msgid "Navigate to menu::Systems[Custom System Info] page."
msgstr "Buka halaman menu::Systems[Custom System Info]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:41
msgid "As `Key Label` fill in `saltboot_force_repartition`."
msgstr "Isi `Key Label` dengan `saltboot_force_repartition`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:42
msgid "As `Description` fill in `Force terminal disk repartition`."
msgstr "Isi `Description` dengan `Force terminal disk repartition`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Creating `saltboot_force_repartition` custom key is one time operation.  "
"Once created, it is available for repeated use."
msgstr "Pembuatan kunci khusus `saltboot_force_repartition` hanya perlu dilakukan satu kali.  Setelah dibuat, kunci ini dapat digunakan berulang kali."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assign custom value for disk repartitioning"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan nilai khusus untuk pengaturan ulang partisi disk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:49
msgid "From the list of available keys click `saltboot_force_repartition`."
msgstr "Dari daftar kunci yang tersedia, klik `saltboot_force_repartition`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Force {saltboot} redeployment using {saltboot} API call"
msgstr "Memaksa penerapan ulang {saltboot} menggunakan panggilan API {saltboot}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:54
msgid ""
"After terminal finishes booting, {saltboot} redeployment setting is "
"automatically reset to prevent repeated redeployment."
msgstr "Setelah terminal selesai melakukan boot, pengaturan penerapan ulang {saltboot} direset secara otomatis guna mencegah penerapan ulang berulang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:55
msgid ""
"An API call `system.setPillar` can be used to set specific {saltboot} "
"options through {salt} pillar data.  {productname} {saltboot} integration is "
"using `tuning-saltboot` pillar category to manage {saltboot} tuning, "
"including forced redeployment or disk repartition.  Using this pillar "
"category allows {productname} to reset {saltboot} flag once the terminal is "
"booted up."
msgstr "Panggilan API `system.setPillar` dapat digunakan untuk menetapkan opsi {saltboot} tertentu melalui data pillar {salt}.  Integrasi {saltboot} pada {productname} menggunakan kategori pillar `tuning-saltboot` untuk mengelola penyesuaian {saltboot}, termasuk penerapan ulang paksa atau pengaturan ulang partisi disk.  Penggunaan kategori pillar ini memungkinkan {productname} mereset flag {saltboot} setelah terminal selesai melakukan boot."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Forcing {saltboot} to redeploy image using API call using "
"spacecmd command"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memaksa {saltboot} menerapkan ulang image melalui panggilan API menggunakan perintah spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:57
msgid ""
"In the console run following the command, and replace `$terminal_minion_id` "
"with the actual terminal minion id:"
msgstr "Di konsol, jalankan perintah berikut dan ganti `$terminal_minion_id` dengan ID minion terminal yang sebenarnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd api -- -A '$terminal_minion_id,tuning-saltboot,{\"saltboot\": "
"{\"force_redeployment\": \"True\"}}' system.setPillar\n"
msgstr "spacecmd api -- -A '$terminal_minion_id,tuning-saltboot,{\"saltboot\": {\"force_redeployment\": \"True\"}}' system.setPillar\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Forcing {saltboot} to repartition disk using API call using "
"spacecmd command"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memaksa {saltboot} mempartisi ulang disk melalui panggilan API menggunakan perintah spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:60
msgid ""
"In the console run the following command, replace `$terminal_minion_id` with "
"the actual terminal minion id:"
msgstr "Di konsol, jalankan perintah berikut dan ganti `$terminal_minion_id` dengan ID minion terminal yang sebenarnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd api -- -A '$terminal_minion_id,tuning-saltboot,{\"saltboot\": "
"{\"force_repartition\": \"True\"}}' system.setPillar\n"
msgstr "spacecmd api -- -A '$terminal_minion_id,tuning-saltboot,{\"saltboot\": {\"force_repartition\": \"True\"}}' system.setPillar\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Check {saltboot} tuning options"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memeriksa opsi penyesuaian {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:63
msgid ""
"In the console run the following command, and replace `$terminal_minion_id` "
"with the actual terminal minion id:"
msgstr "Di konsol, jalankan perintah berikut dan ganti `$terminal_minion_id` dengan ID minion terminal yang sebenarnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd api -- -A '$terminal_minion_id,tuning-saltboot' system.getPillar\n"
msgstr "spacecmd api -- -A '$terminal_minion_id,tuning-saltboot' system.getPillar\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:65
msgid "Make sure to use `tuning-saltboot` as pillar category in the API call."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda menggunakan `tuning-saltboot` sebagai kategori pillar dalam panggilan API."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Force {saltboot} redeployment by custom pillar"
msgstr "Memaksa penerapan ulang {saltboot} menggunakan pillar khusus"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Pillars specified outside of {productname} database cannot be reset "
"automatically.  Without manual intervention, the terminal will download a "
"new image on each reboot."
msgstr "Pillar yang ditentukan di luar basis data {productname} tidak dapat direset secara otomatis.  Tanpa intervensi manual, terminal akan mengunduh image baru setiap kali dimulai ulang."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Force a {saltboot} to redeploy image using {saltboot} pillar"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memaksa {saltboot} menerapkan ulang image menggunakan pillar {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:69
msgid "Create new file `/srv/salt/pillar/force_redeploy.sls` with content:"
msgstr "Buat berkas baru `/srv/salt/pillar/force_redeploy.sls` dengan isi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saltboot:\n"
"  force_redeploy: True\n"
msgstr ""
"saltboot:\n"
"  force_redeploy: True\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:71
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Create new file or update existing file named `/srv/salt/pillar/top.sls` "
"with content:"
msgstr "Buat berkas baru atau perbarui berkas yang sudah ada bernama `/srv/salt/pillar/top.sls` dengan isi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base:\n"
"  '$terminal_minion_id':\n"
"    - force_redeploy\n"
msgstr ""
"base:\n"
"  '$terminal_minion_id':\n"
"    - force_redeploy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:74
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:82
msgid ""
"After the terminal finishes booting, remove modifications made in "
"`/srv/salt/pillar/top.sls` file."
msgstr "Setelah terminal selesai melakukan boot, hapus perubahan yang dibuat dalam berkas `/srv/salt/pillar/top.sls`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:75
msgid ""
"If your terminal encounters a problem with the file system or the partition "
"table, you might need to remove the partition table and reformat the "
"terminal."
msgstr "Jika terminal Anda mengalami masalah pada sistem berkas atau tabel partisi, Anda mungkin perlu menghapus tabel partisi dan memformat ulang terminal."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Force {saltboot} to repartition disk using {saltboot} pillar"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memaksa {saltboot} mempartisi ulang disk menggunakan pillar {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:77
msgid "Create new file `/srv/salt/pillar/force_repartition.sls` with content:"
msgstr "Buat berkas baru `/srv/salt/pillar/force_repartition.sls` dengan isi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saltboot:\n"
"  force_repartition: True\n"
msgstr ""
"saltboot:\n"
"  force_repartition: True\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-saltboot-redeployment.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base:\n"
"  '$terminal_minion_id':\n"
"    - force_repartition\n"
msgstr ""
"base:\n"
"  '$terminal_minion_id':\n"
"    - force_repartition\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminal Names"
msgstr "Nama Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Terminals can be named according to certain parameters, which can make it "
"easier to match the physical device with its record in the {productname} "
"{webui}."
msgstr "Terminal dapat diberi nama berdasarkan parameter tertentu, sehingga perangkat fisik lebih mudah dicocokkan dengan catatannya di {webui} {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Naming schemes available are `Hostname`, `FQDN`, `HWType`, and `MAC`.  "
"Naming scheme and its configuration can be selected in the `Saltboot Group` "
"formula for containerized branch servers or in the `Branch Network` formula "
"for others.  For more information, see "
"xref:retail:containerized-saltboot.adoc[] and "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc[]."
msgstr "Skema penamaan yang tersedia adalah `Hostname`, `FQDN`, `HWType`, dan `MAC`.  Skema penamaan beserta konfigurasinya dapat dipilih dalam formula `Saltboot Group` untuk server cabang berbasis kontainer atau dalam formula `Branch Network` untuk server cabang lainnya.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:containerized-saltboot.adoc[] dan xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:4
msgid ""
"By default, terminals are named according to the `Hostname` naming scheme "
"with the `HWType` scheme as a fallback."
msgstr "Secara default, terminal diberi nama berdasarkan skema penamaan `Hostname`, dengan skema `HWType` sebagai cadangan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Naming by `HWType`"
msgstr "Penamaan berdasarkan `HWType`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:6
msgid "Terminal names that are derived from the hardware type use this format:"
msgstr "Nama terminal yang berasal dari jenis perangkat keras menggunakan format berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "BranchID.Manufacturer-ProductName-SerialNumber-UniqueID\n"
msgstr "BranchID.Manufacturer-ProductName-SerialNumber-UniqueID\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:8
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:16
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:24
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:32
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "Sebagai contoh:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "B002.TOSHIBA-6140100-41BA03X-c643\n"
msgstr "B002.TOSHIBA-6140100-41BA03X-c643\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The `BranchID` is the unique identifier for the branch server that the "
"terminal is connected to.  You can disable this prefix by toggling the `Do "
"not prefix {salt} client ID with Branch ID`."
msgstr "`BranchID` adalah pengenal unik server cabang yang terhubung dengan terminal.  Anda dapat menonaktifkan awalan ini dengan mengubah opsi `Do not prefix {salt} client ID with Branch ID`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The `Manufacturer`, `ProductName`, and `SerialNumber` are provided by the "
"terminal hardware BIOS.  If the terminal does not provide a serial number, "
"it will be omitted from the terminal name."
msgstr "`Manufacturer`, `ProductName`, dan `SerialNumber` disediakan oleh BIOS perangkat keras terminal.  Jika terminal tidak menyediakan nomor seri, bagian tersebut akan dihilangkan dari nama terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The `UniqueID` is the first four characters of a generated machine "
"identification number.  Added unique ID is a requirement for successful "
"terminal deployment.  Without unique ID, subsequent terminal registration "
"will fail.  You can disable this behavior by toggling the `Do not append "
"unique suffix to the {salt} client ID`."
msgstr "`UniqueID` adalah empat karakter pertama dari nomor identifikasi mesin yang dihasilkan.  Penambahan ID unik merupakan persyaratan agar penerapan terminal berhasil.  Tanpa ID unik, pendaftaran terminal berikutnya akan gagal.  Anda dapat menonaktifkan perilaku ini dengan mengubah opsi `Do not append unique suffix to the {salt} client ID`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Naming by `Hostname`"
msgstr "Penamaan berdasarkan `Hostname`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:14
msgid "Terminal names that are derived from the hostname use this format:"
msgstr "Nama terminal yang berasal dari nama host menggunakan format berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "BranchID.Hostname-UniqueID\n"
msgstr "BranchID.Hostname-UniqueID\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "B002.terminal-c643\n"
msgstr "B002.terminal-c643\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:18
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:26
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The `BranchID` is the unique identifier for the branch server that the "
"terminal is connected to.  You can disable this prefix by toggling the `Do "
"not prefix {salt} client ID with Branch ID` checkbox."
msgstr "`BranchID` adalah pengenal unik server cabang yang terhubung dengan terminal.  Anda dapat menonaktifkan awalan ini dengan mengubah kotak centang `Do not prefix {salt} client ID with Branch ID`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:19
msgid "The `Hostname` is the plain hostname (without domain part) of the terminal."
msgstr "`Hostname` adalah nama host terminal tanpa bagian domain."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:20
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:28
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The `UniqueID` is the first four characters of a generated machine "
"identification number.  You can disable this behavior by toggling the `Do "
"not append unique suffix to the {salt} client ID` checkbox."
msgstr "`UniqueID` adalah empat karakter pertama dari nomor identifikasi mesin yang dihasilkan.  Anda dapat menonaktifkan perilaku ini dengan mengubah kotak centang `Do not append unique suffix to the {salt} client ID`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Naming by `FQDN`"
msgstr "Penamaan berdasarkan `FQDN`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Terminal names that are derived from the Fully Qualified Domain Names (FQDN) "
"use this format:"
msgstr "Nama terminal yang berasal dari nama domain lengkap (FQDN) menggunakan format berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "BranchID.FQDN-UniqueID\n"
msgstr "BranchID.FQDN-UniqueID\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "B002.terminal.example.com-c643\n"
msgstr "B002.terminal.example.com-c643\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:27
msgid "The `FQDN` is the fully qualified domain name of the terminal."
msgstr "`FQDN` adalah nama domain lengkap terminal."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Naming by `MAC`"
msgstr "Penamaan berdasarkan `MAC`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Terminal names are derived from the network interface hardware address (MAC) "
"and use this format:"
msgstr "Nama terminal berasal dari alamat perangkat keras antarmuka jaringan (MAC) dan menggunakan format berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "BranchID.MAC-UniqueID\n"
msgstr "BranchID.MAC-UniqueID\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "B0002.52:54:00:62:18:6f-cb83\n"
msgstr "B0002.52:54:00:62:18:6f-cb83\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The `MAC` is colon delimited hardware address of the network interface card "
"used for booting of the terminal."
msgstr "`MAC` adalah alamat perangkat keras yang dipisahkan dengan tanda titik dua dari kartu antarmuka jaringan yang digunakan untuk melakukan boot terminal."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign Hostnames to Terminals"
msgstr "Menetapkan Nama Host untuk Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:38
msgid ""
"If you want terminal names to be derived from the hostname, you will need to "
"ensure your terminals have a static hostname.  This requires a static IP "
"address to be able to resolve the static hostname."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin nama terminal berasal dari nama host, pastikan terminal memiliki nama host statis.  Hal ini memerlukan alamat IP statis agar nama host statis dapat diresolusikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:39
msgid ""
"There are a number of different ways to assign hostnames to terminals.  This "
"section describes how to do this when DNS and DHCP services are managed by "
"the non-containerized branch server."
msgstr "Ada beberapa cara untuk menetapkan nama host bagi terminal.  Bagian ini menjelaskan cara melakukannya ketika layanan DNS dan DHCP dikelola oleh server cabang yang tidak berbasis kontainer."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning IP Address and Hostname with Formulas"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan Alamat IP dan Nama Host dengan Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In the DHCP formula settings, navigate to `Hosts with Static IP Address` and "
"click btn:[Add Item].  For more information on the DHCP formula, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[]."
msgstr "Dalam pengaturan formula DHCP, buka `Hosts with Static IP Address`, lalu klik btn:[Add Item].  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula DHCP, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:42
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:49
msgid "In the `Hostname` field, type the hostname of the branch server."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Hostname`, ketik nama host server cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:43
msgid ""
"In the `IP Address` field, type the static IP address for the terminal.  "
"Ensure the IP address is within the range used by the branch server."
msgstr "Pada kolom `IP Address`, ketik alamat IP statis untuk terminal.  Pastikan alamat IP berada dalam rentang yang digunakan oleh server cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In the `Hardware Type and Address` field, type the hardware type and address "
"in this format:"
msgstr "Pada kolom `Hardware Type and Address`, ketik jenis dan alamat perangkat keras dalam format berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "ethernet <terminal_MAC_address>\n"
msgstr "ethernet <terminal_MAC_address>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:46
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:51
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: For multiple terminals, click btn:[Add Item] and fill in the "
"details for each terminal."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Untuk beberapa terminal, klik btn:[Add Item], lalu isi rincian setiap terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:47
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:52
msgid "Click btn:[Save Formula] to save the changes."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Save Formula] untuk menyimpan perubahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:48
msgid ""
"In the Bind formula settings, navigate to the A records of the appropriate "
"non-reverse zone, and click btn:[Add Item].  For more information on the "
"bind formula, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc[]."
msgstr "Dalam pengaturan formula Bind, buka rekaman A pada zona non-reverse yang sesuai, lalu klik btn:[Add Item].  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula bind, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the `IP Address` field, type the static IP address you assigned to the "
"terminal in the DHCP formula settings."
msgstr "Pada kolom `IP Address`, ketik alamat IP statis yang telah Anda tetapkan untuk terminal dalam pengaturan formula DHCP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:53
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:63
msgid "Apply the highstate on the branch server to apply the changes."
msgstr "Terapkan highstate pada server cabang untuk menerapkan perubahan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:54
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:64
msgid ""
"If the terminal was previously registered using a name based on the hardware "
"type instead of the hostname, you will need to delete the previous "
"registration.  When you re-register the terminal, use the new terminal name."
msgstr "Jika terminal sebelumnya didaftarkan menggunakan nama berdasarkan jenis perangkat keras, bukan nama host, Anda perlu menghapus pendaftaran sebelumnya.  Saat mendaftarkan ulang terminal, gunakan nama terminal baru."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning IP Address and Hostname with YAML"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan Alamat IP dan Nama Host dengan YAML"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:56
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the branch server, export a YAML configuration "
"file:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah di server cabang, ekspor berkas konfigurasi YAML:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_yaml --to-yaml retail.yaml\n"
msgstr "retail_yaml --to-yaml retail.yaml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Open the YAML file and navigate to the end of the branch server section.  "
"Add a new `terminals` section if it does not already exist."
msgstr "Buka berkas YAML, lalu buka bagian akhir konfigurasi server cabang.  Tambahkan bagian `terminals` baru jika belum ada."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Add the IP address, MAC address, and hardware type for the terminal, using "
"this format:"
msgstr "Tambahkan alamat IP, alamat MAC, dan jenis perangkat keras terminal menggunakan format berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$hostname:\n"
"        IP: <IP_Address>\n"
"        hwAddress: <MAC_Address>\n"
"        hwtype: <HWTYPE_Group_name_without_HWTYPE:_prefix>\n"
msgstr ""
"$hostname:\n"
"        IP: <IP_Address>\n"
"        hwAddress: <MAC_Address>\n"
"        hwtype: <HWTYPE_Group_name_without_HWTYPE:_prefix>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:61
msgid "Import the modified YAML file:"
msgstr "Impor berkas YAML yang telah diubah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_yaml --from-yaml retail.yaml\n"
msgstr "retail_yaml --from-yaml retail.yaml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-names.adoc:65
msgid ""
"For more information about using YAML configuration files, see "
"xref:retail:retail-mass-config.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan berkas konfigurasi YAML, lihat xref:retail:retail-mass-config.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-ratelimiting.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rate Limiting Terminals"
msgstr "Pembatasan Laju pada Terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-ratelimiting.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt is able to run commands in parallel on a large number of terminals.  "
"This can potentially create heavy load on your infrastructure.  You can use "
"rate-limiting parameters to control the load in your environment."
msgstr "Salt dapat menjalankan perintah secara paralel pada banyak terminal.  Hal ini berpotensi menimbulkan beban berat pada infrastruktur Anda.  Anda dapat menggunakan parameter pembatasan laju untuk mengontrol beban di lingkungan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-ratelimiting.adoc:3
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-ratelimiting.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information about rate limiting on terminals, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pembatasan laju pada terminal, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-ratelimiting.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-terminal-ratelimiting.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Sometimes when attempting to reboot a terminal after attempting to apply the "
"{saltboot} formula, the terminal will hang at the boot screen.  This can be "
"caused by a presence ping timeout value being set at a value that is too "
"low.  You can adjust the presence ping timeout value to fix this problem."
msgstr "Terkadang, saat mencoba memulai ulang terminal setelah mencoba menerapkan formula {saltboot}, terminal akan macet pada layar boot.  Hal ini dapat disebabkan oleh nilai batas waktu presence ping yang terlalu rendah.  Anda dapat menyesuaikan nilai batas waktu presence ping untuk mengatasi masalah ini."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-upgrade-branchserver.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade {productname} {smr} Branch Server"
msgstr "Meningkatkan Versi Server Cabang {productname} {smr}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-upgrade-branchserver.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section describes upgrading the {productname} {smr} Branch Server to "
"the next SP (service pack)."
msgstr "Bagian ini menjelaskan peningkatan versi Server Cabang {productname} {smr} ke SP (service pack) berikutnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-upgrade-branchserver.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The {productname} {smr} Branch Server is a client system similar to the "
"{productname} Proxy, with additional {productname} {smr} features."
msgstr "Server Cabang {productname} {smr} adalah sistem klien yang serupa dengan Proxy {productname}, dengan fitur tambahan {productname} {smr}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-upgrade-branchserver.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Upgrade the {productname} Server before starting the {productname} {smr} "
"upgrade."
msgstr "Tingkatkan versi Server {productname} sebelum memulai peningkatan versi {productname} {smr}."

#.  FIXME
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-upgrade-branchserver.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading the {productname} {smr} Branch Server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Meningkatkan Versi Server Cabang {productname} {smr}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-upgrade-branchserver.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For general information about upgrading a proxy client, see the release "
"notes and the proxy sections of the Installation and Upgrade Guide."
msgstr "Untuk informasi umum tentang peningkatan versi klien proxy, lihat catatan rilis dan bagian proxy dalam Panduan Instalasi dan Peningkatan Versi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-upgrade-branchserver.adoc:7
msgid ""
"After the proxy upgrade is complete, apply the highstate on the "
"{productname} {smr} Branch Server.  When applying the highstate, the retail "
"functionality will also be updated."
msgstr "Setelah peningkatan versi proxy selesai, terapkan highstate pada Server Cabang {productname} {smr}.  Saat highstate diterapkan, fungsionalitas ritel juga akan diperbarui."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retail Uyuni Branch Server"
msgstr "Server Cabang Uyuni Retail"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers {productname} {smr} Branch Server installation and "
"setup, using these procedures:"
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas instalasi dan penyiapan Server Cabang {productname} {smr} melalui prosedur berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:3
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:9
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Software Channels"
msgstr "Menambahkan Kanal Perangkat Lunak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:4
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:14
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check Synchronization Status"
msgstr "Memeriksa Status Sinkronisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:5
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:16
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trust GPG Keys on Clients"
msgstr "Memercayai Kunci GPG pada Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:6
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:26
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register the Branch Server and Terminals as Clients"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Server Cabang dan Terminal sebagai Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The {productname} {smr} Branch Server is a {productname} Proxy with "
"additional Retail features.  For proxy installation procedures, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "Server Cabang {productname} {smr} adalah Proxy {productname} dengan fitur Ritel tambahan.  Untuk prosedur instalasi proxy, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:8
msgid "Then continue with the following sections."
msgstr "Kemudian, lanjutkan ke bagian-bagian berikut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before you register {productname} branch servers and terminals to your "
"{productname} Server, check that you have the {opensuse} product enabled, "
"and the required channels are fully synchronized."
msgstr "Sebelum mendaftarkan server cabang dan terminal {productname} ke Server {productname} Anda, pastikan produk {opensuse} telah diaktifkan dan kanal yang diperlukan telah disinkronkan sepenuhnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:11
msgid "The products you need for this procedure are:"
msgstr "Produk yang Anda perlukan untuk prosedur ini adalah:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "{opensuse} Channels - CLI"
msgstr "Kanal {opensuse} - CLI"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version               | {opensuse} Leap 15.4\n"
"| Base Channel\t\t   | opensuse_leap15_4\n"
"| Client Channel\t   | opensuse_leap15_4-uyuni-client\n"
"| Updates Channel\t   | opensuse_leap15_4-updates\n"
"| Non-OSS Channel\t   | opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss\n"
"| Non-OSS Updates Channel  | opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates\n"
"| Backports Updates Channel| opensuse_leap15_4-backports-updates\n"
"| SLE Updates Channel\t   | opensuse_leap15_4-sle-updates\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| Versi OS               | {opensuse} Leap 15.4\n"
"| Kanal Dasar   | opensuse_leap15_4\n"
"| Kanal Klien   | opensuse_leap15_4-uyuni-client\n"
"| Kanal Pembaruan   | opensuse_leap15_4-updates\n"
"| Kanal Non-OSS   | opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss\n"
"| Kanal Pembaruan Non-OSS  | opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates\n"
"| Kanal Pembaruan Backports| opensuse_leap15_4-backports-updates\n"
"| Kanal Pembaruan SLE   | opensuse_leap15_4-sle-updates\n"
"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:15
msgid ""
"{opensuse} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take "
"several hours."
msgstr "Kanal {opensuse} dapat berukuran sangat besar.  Sinkronisasi terkadang dapat memerlukan waktu beberapa jam."

#.  FIXME Starting from here, everything is preliminary
#.  Feedback provided by Lukas
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Activation Key for a Branch Server and the Retail Terminal Images"
msgstr "Membuat Kunci Aktivasi untuk Server Cabang dan Image Terminal Ritel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The branch server is based on the {productname} Proxy.  Its activation key "
"must contain these child channels:"
msgstr "Server cabang berbasis Proxy {productname}.  Kunci aktivasinya harus mencakup kanal turunan berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:19
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:23
msgid "openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} Updates (x86_64)"
msgstr "Pembaruan openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} (x86_64)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:20
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:24
msgid "Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} (x86_64)"
msgstr "Alat Klien Uyuni untuk openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} (x86_64)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:21
msgid "Uyuni Proxy Stable for openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} (x86_64)"
msgstr "Uyuni Proxy Stable untuk openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} (x86_64)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The activation key for retail terminal images based on openSUSE "
"Leap {opensuse-version} must contain these child channels:"
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi untuk image terminal ritel berbasis openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} harus mencakup kanal turunan berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For more information about creating activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pembuatan kunci aktivasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:27
msgid ""
"You register both the branch server and the terminals as openSUSE clients.  "
"To register your openSUSE clients, you need a bootstrap repository.  By "
"default, bootstrap repositories are automatically created, and regenerated "
"daily for all synchronized products.  You can manually create the bootstrap "
"repository from the command prompt, using this command:"
msgstr "Daftarkan server cabang dan terminal sebagai klien openSUSE.  Untuk mendaftarkan klien openSUSE, Anda memerlukan repositori bootstrap.  Secara default, repositori bootstrap dibuat secara otomatis dan dibuat ulang setiap hari untuk semua produk yang telah disinkronkan.  Anda dapat membuat repositori bootstrap secara manual dari prompt perintah menggunakan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --with-custom-channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --with-custom-channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information on registering your clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pendaftaran klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register the Branch Server"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Server Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:31
msgid ""
"A retail branch server is registered as an openSUSE proxy.  The proxy can be "
"bootstrapped using the {webui}, or at the command prompt.  Ensure you use "
"the activation key you created for the proxy."
msgstr "Server cabang ritel didaftarkan sebagai proxy openSUSE.  Bootstrap proxy dapat dilakukan menggunakan {webui} atau melalui prompt perintah.  Pastikan Anda menggunakan kunci aktivasi yang telah dibuat untuk proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For more information about proxies, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang proxy, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For more information about activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang kunci aktivasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the Uyuni Proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan Proxy Uyuni"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Check that the `Uyuni Proxy Stable for openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} "
"(x86_64)` channel is assigned to the proxy on the system profile page."
msgstr "Pastikan kanal `Uyuni Proxy Stable for openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} (x86_64)` ditetapkan ke proxy pada halaman profil sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:36
msgid "At the command prompt on the proxy, as root, install the proxy pattern:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah di proxy, sebagai root, instal pola proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in -t pattern uyuni_proxy\n"
msgstr "zypper in -t pattern uyuni_proxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:38
msgid "Finalize the proxy setup:"
msgstr "Selesaikan penyiapan proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "configure-proxy.sh\n"
msgstr "configure-proxy.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `configure-proxy.sh` is an interactive script.\n"
msgstr "  `configure-proxy.sh` adalah skrip interaktif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:41
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you want to use the same system also as a build host, navigate "
"to the client's system profile and check `OS Image Build Host` as a `Add-On "
"System Types`."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Jika Anda juga ingin menggunakan sistem yang sama sebagai host build, buka profil sistem klien dan centang `OS Image Build Host` sebagai `Add-On System Types`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Configure the proxy to become a branch server.  On the {productname} {smr} "
"Server, for example, run:"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan proxy agar menjadi server cabang.  Sebagai contoh, pada Server {productname} {smr}, jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"retail_branch_init <branch_server_minion_id> --dedicated-nic eth1 \\\n"
"    --branch-ip 192.168.7.5 \\\n"
"    --netmask 255.255.255.0 \\\n"
"    --dyn-range 192.168.7.100 192.168.7.200 \\\n"
"    --server-domain branch.example.org \\\n"
"    --branch-prefix uyuni\n"
msgstr ""
"retail_branch_init <branch_server_minion_id> --dedicated-nic eth1 \\\n"
"    --branch-ip 192.168.7.5 \\\n"
"    --netmask 255.255.255.0 \\\n"
"    --dyn-range 192.168.7.100 192.168.7.200 \\\n"
"    --server-domain branch.example.org \\\n"
"    --branch-prefix uyuni\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-branchserver.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "  For additional options,  use the `retail_branch_init --help` command.\n"
msgstr "  Untuk opsi tambahan,  gunakan perintah `retail_branch_init --help`.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retail Uyuni Server Setup"
msgstr "Penyiapan Server Uyuni Retail"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers {productname} {smr} Server setup, using these "
"procedures:"
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas penyiapan Server {productname} {smr} melalui prosedur berikut:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:3
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up {productname} with {yast}"
msgstr "Menyiapkan {productname} dengan {yast}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:4
msgid "Create the main administration account"
msgstr "Membuat akun administrasi utama"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:10
msgid "This section guides you through {productname} setup procedures."
msgstr "Bagian ini memandu Anda melalui prosedur penyiapan {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: {productname} Setup"
msgstr "Prosedur: Penyiapan {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:12
msgid "On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, start {yast}:"
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, di prompt perintah, sebagai root, jalankan {yast}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2\n"
msgstr "yast2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:14
msgid "Navigate to menu:Network Services[Uyuni Setup] to begin set up."
msgstr "Buka menu:Network Services[Uyuni Setup] untuk memulai penyiapan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"From the introduction screen, select menu:Uyuni Setup[Set up Uyuni from "
"scratch] and click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "Pada layar pengantar, pilih menu:Uyuni Setup[Set up Uyuni from scratch], lalu klik btn:[Next] untuk melanjutkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Type an email address to receive status notifications and click btn:[Next] "
"to continue.  {productname} can sometimes send a large volume of "
"notification emails.  You can disable email notifications in the {webui} "
"after setup, if you need to."
msgstr "Ketik alamat email untuk menerima notifikasi status, lalu klik btn:[Next] untuk melanjutkan.  {productname} terkadang dapat mengirim email notifikasi dalam jumlah besar.  Jika diperlukan, Anda dapat menonaktifkan notifikasi email di {webui} setelah penyiapan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Type your certificate information and provide a password.  Passwords must be "
"at least seven characters in length, and must not contain spaces, single or "
"double quotation marks (`'` or `\"`), exclamation marks (`!`), or dollar "
"signs (`$`).  Always store your passwords in a secure location.  You must "
"have the certificate password to set up the {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "Masukkan informasi sertifikat Anda dan tetapkan kata sandi.  Kata sandi harus terdiri atas setidaknya tujuh karakter dan tidak boleh mengandung spasi, tanda petik tunggal atau ganda (`'` atau `\"`), tanda seru (`!`), atau tanda dolar (`$`).  Selalu simpan kata sandi Anda di lokasi yang aman.  Anda harus memiliki kata sandi sertifikat untuk menyiapkan Proxy {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:18
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Next] to continue.\n"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Next] untuk melanjutkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Uyuni Setup[Database Settings] screen, type a database "
"username and password, and click btn:[Next] to continue.  Passwords must be "
"at least seven characters in length, and must not contain spaces, single or "
"double quotation marks (`'` or `\"`), exclamation marks (`!`), or dollar "
"signs (`$`).  Always store your passwords in a secure location."
msgstr "Buka layar menu:Uyuni Setup[Database Settings], ketik nama pengguna dan kata sandi basis data, lalu klik btn:[Next] untuk melanjutkan.  Kata sandi harus terdiri atas setidaknya tujuh karakter dan tidak boleh mengandung spasi, tanda petik tunggal atau ganda (`'` atau `\"`), tanda seru (`!`), atau tanda dolar (`$`).  Selalu simpan kata sandi Anda di lokasi yang aman."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:21
msgid "Click btn:[Yes] to begin the setup process."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Yes] untuk memulai proses penyiapan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:22
msgid ""
"When setup is complete, click btn:[Next] to continue.  Take note of the "
"address to access the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Setelah penyiapan selesai, klik btn:[Next] untuk melanjutkan.  Catat alamat untuk mengakses {webui} {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Finish] to complete {productname} setup."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Finish] untuk menyelesaikan penyiapan {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the Main Administration Account"
msgstr "Membuat Akun Administrasi Utama"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This section covers how to create your organization's main administration "
"account for {productname}."
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas cara membuat akun administrasi utama organisasi Anda untuk {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The main administration account has the highest authority within "
"{productname}.  Ensure you keep access information for this account secure.  "
"We recommend that you create lower level administration accounts for "
"organizations and groups.  Do not share the main administration access "
"details."
msgstr "Akun administrasi utama memiliki wewenang tertinggi dalam {productname}.  Pastikan informasi akses akun ini tetap aman.  Sebaiknya buat akun administrasi dengan tingkat wewenang yang lebih rendah untuk organisasi dan grup.  Jangan bagikan rincian akses administrasi utama."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the Main Administration Account"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan Akun Administrasi Utama"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In your web browser, enter the address for the {productname} {webui}.  This "
"address was provided after you completed setup.  For more information, see "
"xref:retail:retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc#retail-server-setup-yast[]."
msgstr "Di peramban web Anda, masukkan alamat {webui} {productname}.  Alamat ini diberikan setelah Anda menyelesaikan penyiapan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:retail:retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc#retail-server-setup-yast[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Sign in to the {webui}, navigate to the menu:Create "
"Organization[Organization Name] field, and enter your organization name."
msgstr "Masuk ke {webui}, buka kolom menu:Create Organization[Organization Name], lalu masukkan nama organisasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In the menu:Create Organization[Desired Login] and menu:Create "
"Organization[Desired Password] fields, enter your username and password."
msgstr "Pada kolom menu:Create Organization[Desired Login] dan menu:Create Organization[Desired Password], masukkan nama pengguna dan kata sandi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Complete the `Account Information` fields, including an email for system "
"notifications."
msgstr "Lengkapi kolom `Account Information`, termasuk alamat email untuk notifikasi sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Organization] to finish creating your administration "
"account."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Organization] untuk menyelesaikan pembuatan akun administrasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc:33
msgid ""
"When you have completed the {productname} {webui} setup, you are taken to "
"the menu:Home[Overview] page."
msgstr "Setelah menyelesaikan penyiapan {webui} {productname}, Anda akan diarahkan ke halaman menu:Home[Overview]."

#
#
