#. feature without support.
#. Then it is possible to build the image using modified kiwi profile and deploy it to terminal as usual (there is
#. nothing specific for Uuyni).
#. The rest of things ({saltboot} formula and formula for image syncing works just the same way as MLM.)
#. Only thing that behaves differently is naming of terminals, for some reason dashes are used instead of
#. HWTYPE (for example). But fortunately it has no impact on (at least basic) functionality of terminal.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set Up the {productname} {smr} Environment with shared network between "
"terminals, branch servers and {productname}"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Lingkungan {productname} {smr} dengan jaringan bersama antara terminal, server cabang, dan {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In this example we consider architecture with shared network between POS "
"terminals, branch server and {productname} where branch server provides only "
"PXE configuration and images."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, digunakan arsitektur dengan jaringan bersama antara terminal POS, server cabang, dan {productname}, dengan server cabang hanya menyediakan konfigurasi PXE dan image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In this example we provide `salt` on kernel command line option and `ftp` in "
"pillar for {saltboot} service discovery."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, `salt` disediakan melalui opsi baris perintah kernel dan `ftp` dalam pillar untuk penemuan layanan {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:13
msgid ""
"There is already existing external DHCP and DNS service.  DHCP service is "
"correctly configured to PXE boot from branch server."
msgstr "Layanan DHCP dan DNS eksternal sudah tersedia.  Layanan DHCP telah dikonfigurasi dengan benar untuk melakukan boot PXE dari server cabang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Follow guide xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[] to create the "
"system groups:"
msgstr "Ikuti panduan xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[] untuk membuat grup sistem berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:19
msgid ""
"First group is generic optional group for collecting all POS "
"terminals. Second group is hardware type group for our POS terminal. Third "
"group is mandatory branch group.s"
msgstr "Grup pertama adalah grup umum opsional untuk menghimpun semua terminal POS. Grup kedua adalah grup jenis perangkat keras untuk terminal POS kita. Grup ketiga adalah grup cabang wajib."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign and configure formulas"
msgstr "Menetapkan dan mengonfigurasi formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:22
msgid "We assign following formulas to the branch server:"
msgstr "Tetapkan formula berikut ke server cabang:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assign formulas to the branch server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan formula ke server cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Unselect `Dedicated Nic` check-box because we are not using dedicated "
"network"
msgstr "Hapus centang pada kotak `Dedicated Nic` karena kita tidak menggunakan jaringan khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In `Terminal Naming and Identification` section edit `Branch Identification` "
"and set it to our branch id `B0001`"
msgstr "Pada bagian `Terminal Naming and Identification`, edit `Branch Identification` dan atur ke ID cabang kita, yaitu `B0001`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Set `Internal Network Address` to `0.0.0.0`, this way tftp will be listening "
"on any IPv4"
msgstr "Atur `Internal Network Address` ke `0.0.0.0` agar tftp menerima koneksi pada semua alamat IPv4"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:47
msgid "Set `TFTP base directory` to `/srv/saltboot`"
msgstr "Atur `TFTP base directory` ke `/srv/saltboot`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Next two formulas are group formulas.  Make sure you are editing those "
"formulas in their respective groups."
msgstr "Dua formula berikutnya adalah formula grup.  Pastikan Anda mengedit formula tersebut dalam grupnya masing-masing."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Group formulas are visible as assigned also on system level, but editing "
"them will create system specific setting instead of group setting."
msgstr "Formula grup juga terlihat sebagai formula yang ditetapkan pada tingkat sistem, tetapi mengeditnya akan membuat pengaturan khusus sistem, bukan pengaturan grup."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Assign `Saltboot Group` formula to the `B0001` group and `Saltboot` formula "
"to the `HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000` group."
msgstr "Tetapkan formula `Saltboot Group` ke grup `B0001` dan formula `Saltboot` ke grup `HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assign {saltboot} Group formula to Branch group"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan formula {saltboot} Group ke grup Cabang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:54
msgid "Select group `B0001`, which is our branch group"
msgstr "Pilih grup `B0001`, yaitu grup cabang kita"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:57
msgid "In displayed list select `Saltboot Group`"
msgstr "Pada daftar yang ditampilkan, pilih `Saltboot Group`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:58
msgid "Save assigned formulas by clicking btn:[Save] in the top right corner"
msgstr "Simpan formula yang ditetapkan dengan mengeklik btn:[Save] di sudut kanan atas"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configure {saltboot} Group formula"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi formula {saltboot} Group"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:60
msgid "Select {saltboot} Group formula from `B0001` group formula list"
msgstr "Pilih formula {saltboot} Group dari daftar formula grup `B0001`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:61
msgid "Set `Image download server` to `branch1.mystore.com`"
msgstr "Atur `Image download server` ke `branch1.mystore.com`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Unselect `Branch server is containerized proxy` because this is not "
"containerized proxy"
msgstr "Hapus centang pada `Branch server is containerized proxy` karena proxy ini tidak berbasis kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:8
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For additional guidance, refer to the **{productname} documentation suite** "
"at https://www.uyuni-project.org/uyuni-docs."
msgstr "Untuk panduan tambahan, lihat **kumpulan dokumentasi {productname}** di https://www.uyuni-project.org/uyuni-docs."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Retail\n"
"{productname} {productnumber}"
msgstr ""
"Ritel\n"
"{productname} {productnumber}"

